THAT IS JUST HIS TYPE.

420
00:16:46,372 --> 00:16:49,175
- AND YOU'LL BE HURT.
- I DON'T THINK SO.

421
00:16:49,809 --> 00:16:51,644
[CROW] I'M SO UPSET
I MIGHT BINGE ON A SALTINE.

422
00:16:51,711 --> 00:16:53,246
HE DIDN'T EVEN
COME TO THE DOOR FOR YOU.

423
00:16:53,813 --> 00:16:55,615
HE WOULDN'T BE JERRY
IF HE DID.

424
00:16:55,681 --> 00:16:57,350
[MIKE] AND THAT'S A GOOD THING?

425
00:16:58,417 --> 00:17:00,720
[SERVO] I'M SECRETLY IN LOVE
WITH JERRY, TOO.

426
00:17:03,155 --> 00:17:04,390
ANGIE-BABY!

427
00:17:05,024 --> 00:17:06,459
[SERVO] I HAD AN ACCIDENT.

428
00:17:08,027 --> 00:17:09,395
[MIKE] I WANNA BE JERRY TOO.

429
00:17:10,496 --> 00:17:11,764
HOW'S COLLEGE?

430
00:17:12,932 --> 00:17:14,767
FINE. YOU SHOULD TRY IT
SOMETIME.

431
00:17:14,967 --> 00:17:17,837
NO THANKS.
THE WORLD'S MY COLLEGE.

432
00:17:17,904 --> 00:17:19,438
[CROW] HE'S TAKING IT PASS/FAIL.

433
00:17:19,505 --> 00:17:21,407
LET'S GO.
SEE YOU LATER, MADISON.

434
00:17:22,808 --> 00:17:25,611
[SERVO] I'D GO WITH, BUT I HAVE
TO GIVE MOTHER HER SPONGE BATH.

435
00:17:27,914 --> 00:17:29,482
[MIKE] OH, MOM'S GOING RUNNING.

436
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:35,221
[CROW] WELL, LET'S HURRY.
WE'VE GOT CORPSES TO PICK UP.

437
00:17:35,288 --> 00:17:38,024
[SERVO HUMS TO RADIO]

438
00:17:38,224 --> 00:17:41,627
[MIKE AS ED GRIMLEY] I'M STANDING
NEXT TO ETHEL KENNEDY, I MUST SAY.

439
00:17:43,229 --> 00:17:45,031
[CROW] WE ARE JOY-RIDING.

440
00:17:45,631 --> 00:17:47,800
[SERVO] COME ON, WORLD,
PULL MY FINGER!

441
00:17:50,503 --> 00:17:51,804
[SERVO] THE SKY!

442
00:17:54,307 --> 00:17:55,575
[SERVO HUMS]

443
00:17:55,641 --> 00:17:57,009
[CROW] AH, THOSE REBELS.

444
00:17:57,076 --> 00:17:58,844
WHY, THEY'RE GONNA PARK
IN A 90-MINUTE ZONE

445
00:17:58,911 --> 00:18:01,013
AND AT A SLIGHT ANGLE.

446
00:18:01,514 --> 00:18:03,549
[SERVO] CLIMB
THE TERRIFYING GAZEBO.

447
00:18:06,886 --> 00:18:08,487
[MIKE] WOW, JERRY,
YOU REALLY KNOW

448
00:18:08,554 --> 00:18:11,157
HOW TO TAKE ME PLACES
I'VE NEVER BEEN BEFORE.

449
00:18:11,824 --> 00:18:14,026
[SERVO WITH ASIAN ACCENT] UM, YOU
SHOULD KNOW THAT I AM FOREIGN.

450
00:18:14,827 --> 00:18:16,462
[CROW] TAKE A RIGHT,
GOOD, THANKS.

451
00:18:16,963 --> 00:18:20,433
[SERVO] SO, CAN FOREIGN PEOPLE GO
TO THIS PLACE? HMM? I'M FOREIGN.

452
00:18:21,701 --> 00:18:23,669
[MONKEY] GET YOUR TICKETS HERE!
GET YOUR TICKETS--

453
00:18:23,736 --> 00:18:26,038
- GET YOUR TICKETS--
- [SERVO] AYE-YI-YI-YI.

454
00:18:26,672 --> 00:18:27,640
[CROW] DID YOU GUYS JUST SEE THAT?

455
00:18:27,707 --> 00:18:29,041
- [SERVO] I DON'T KNOW.
- [CROW] OR DID I IMAGINE IT?

456
00:18:29,108 --> 00:18:30,109
I DON'T...

457
00:18:34,547 --> 00:18:35,848
[MIKE] APPARENTLY, THOSE PEOPLE
DON'T KNOW HOW TO...

458
00:18:35,915 --> 00:18:37,984
[SERVO] GET THEIR TICKETS HERE!
GET THEIR TICKETS HERE!

459
00:18:41,187 --> 00:18:43,122
[CROW] AND HE MISSES THE OCEAN.

460
00:18:45,424 --> 00:18:47,793
[SERVO] COME ON, LET'S GET AWAY
FROM MY WEIRD FOREIGN FRIEND.

461
00:18:48,794 --> 00:18:51,097
[MIKE] OH, DEAR,
HE SHOULD NOT FROLIC.

462
00:18:51,163 --> 00:18:52,898
[MAN] HEY, HAROLD,
LET'S GO, COME ON!

463
00:18:52,965 --> 00:18:55,067
[SERVO] I FOUND SOME
REALLY GOOD MEDICAL WASTE!

464
00:18:57,069 --> 00:19:00,006
[CROW] WHOA, WRONG TURN. I THINK
THEY'RE IN THE GOBI DESERT NOW.

465
00:19:01,073 --> 00:19:02,341
[SERVO] WHEE!

466
00:19:04,143 --> 00:19:05,878
[SERVO] I THREW UP IN YOUR HAIR,
I'M SORRY.

467
00:19:07,246 --> 00:19:09,649
[CROW MIMICS
FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

468
00:19:10,783 --> 00:19:13,052
[MIMICS AGAIN]

469
00:19:15,121 --> 00:19:17,390
[SERVO] RIDE THE WRECKING BALL,
I GUESS.

470
00:19:19,492 --> 00:19:21,994
[CROW] OUTTAKES FROM
THE MANSON FAMILY CHRISTMAS.

471
00:19:24,830 --> 00:19:25,931
[SERVO] NEAT.

472
00:19:25,998 --> 00:19:28,167
- [HAROLD GROANS]
- [SERVO] HIS WILDEBEEST IMPRESSION

473
00:19:28,234 --> 00:19:29,769
GETS 'EM EVERY TIME.

474
00:19:32,338 --> 00:19:34,740
[CROW] HE'S NOT A NATURAL
POLE-DANCER, IS HE?

475
00:19:37,443 --> 00:19:38,878
[MIKE] WOW, THIS
QUARTER-SQUARE-MILE

476
00:19:38,944 --> 00:19:41,180
HAS UNBELIEVABLY
GOOD LIGHT-RAIL TRANSIT.

477
00:19:42,348 --> 00:19:44,450
[CROW] OUR MAIN CHARACTER,
THE ROLLER COASTER.

478
00:19:44,517 --> 00:19:45,985
[SERVO] IT'S THE STORY
OF A ROLLER COASTER

479
00:19:46,052 --> 00:19:47,887
AND ITS LOVE FOR
THE WILD MOUSE.

480
00:19:48,888 --> 00:19:51,023
[SERVO WITH DEEP VOICE]
I THINK THIS ROLLER COASTER

481
00:19:51,090 --> 00:19:52,658
CAN HOLD OUT
FOR ONE MORE RIDE.

482
00:19:54,026 --> 00:19:57,029
[CROW] IF SIX FLAGS OVER TEXAS
HAD DESIGNED THE "L."

483
00:19:57,863 --> 00:19:59,732
[SERVO] FILMED IN NAUSEA-VISION.

484
00:20:01,267 --> 00:20:02,868
[CROW] NOW, WASN'T THERE
AT ONE POINT

485
00:20:02,935 --> 00:20:04,370
A FORTUNE-TELLER WHO KILLED

486
00:20:04,437 --> 00:20:05,638
A DOUGHY MIDDLE-MANAGER GUY

487
00:20:05,705 --> 00:20:06,772
OR AM I THINKING
OF ANOTHER MOVIE?

488
00:20:06,839 --> 00:20:07,973
[SERVO] NO.

489
00:20:09,842 --> 00:20:11,343
[SERVO WITH COUNTRY ACCENT]
OH, HI, RERIDE.

490
00:20:13,512 --> 00:20:15,347
[SERVO] I DRINK,
BUT I DON'T INHALE.

491
00:20:15,648 --> 00:20:17,850
MY FIRST NIGHT ON THE FLOOR
WAS A REAL SPECTACLE,

492
00:20:18,350 --> 00:20:20,519
AND THAT'S THE LAST TIME
I'LL DRINK BEFORE A PERFORMANCE.

493
00:20:20,586 --> 00:20:22,254
[SERVO] I CAN'T STAND HIS ACT.

494
00:20:22,321 --> 00:20:23,689
THE MANAGER WANTED TO FIRE ME,
BUT HE'S A FRIEND OF MINE,

495
00:20:23,756 --> 00:20:24,957
SO HE WOULDN'T FIRE ME.

496
00:20:25,024 --> 00:20:26,292
I TALKED HIM OUT OF IT.

497
00:20:26,358 --> 00:20:27,626
BUT MY WIFE DID SAY--

498
00:20:27,693 --> 00:20:28,994
OH, SHE'S REALLY SOMETHING.

499
00:20:29,061 --> 00:20:31,397
IF I DIDN'T STOP DRINKING,
SHE WAS GONNA LEAVE ME.

500
00:20:31,464 --> 00:20:33,432
[CROW] AH, THE THIRD
GUMBEL BROTHER.

501
00:20:33,499 --> 00:20:34,767
BOY, I'M SURE GONNA MISS HER.

502
00:20:34,834 --> 00:20:36,435
[SERVO] BRING OUT THE NAZIS!

503
00:20:37,870 --> 00:20:39,238
BUT-- BUT YOU KNOW,
WITH MY WIFE,

504
00:20:39,305 --> 00:20:40,973
THERE ARE TWO SIDES
TO EVERY ARGUMENT.

505
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:42,341
[MIKE] WAIT, I THOUGHT SHE LEFT.

506
00:20:42,408 --> 00:20:44,343
MY WIFE'S AND HER MOTHER'S.

507
00:20:44,410 --> 00:20:47,146
[CROW] SO DID THE MOTHER STAY
WHEN THE WIFE LEFT?

508
00:20:47,346 --> 00:20:48,748
BUT THEY'RE REALLY WONDERFUL.

509
00:20:49,849 --> 00:20:52,551
MS. MARGE NEILSON
AND MR. BILL WARD.

510
00:20:52,618 --> 00:20:54,186
LET'S HAVE A BIG
ROUND OF APPLAUSE FOR THEM.

511
00:20:54,653 --> 00:20:56,822
[MIKE] GEORGE C. SCOTT
AS GEORGE M. COHAN.

512
00:20:59,925 --> 00:21:02,228
[SERVO] GUESS THE GENDERS
AND WIN A FREE COCKTAIL.

513
00:21:02,294 --> 00:21:03,529
[CROW LAUGHS]

514
00:21:05,431 --> 00:21:06,866
[CROW] TRANSVESTITE CAM!

515
00:21:09,101 --> 00:21:11,270
[SERVO] PLEASE, THE FUHRER
IS OUT THERE TONIGHT!

516
00:21:13,339 --> 00:21:15,608
- [SERVO] YOU'RE NOT FUNNY.
- [CROW] YOU'RE NOT A WOMAN!

517
00:21:19,712 --> 00:21:20,746
[SERVO] KITTEN?

518
00:21:22,314 --> 00:21:25,451
[SERVO, GERMAN ACCENT] ZIS IS NOT
ZE PRECISION DANCING I'M USED TO!

519
00:21:26,018 --> 00:21:27,953
[SERVO] WHOA...OH...

520
00:21:28,020 --> 00:21:28,921
WHOA.

521
00:21:29,655 --> 00:21:32,091
[MIKE HUMS WITH MUSIC]

522
00:21:32,825 --> 00:21:33,993
[SERVO] I'M CONCERNED.

523
00:21:35,394 --> 00:21:37,630
[MIKE] LET'S WRAP IT UP.
WE'RE BOMBING.

524
00:21:40,499 --> 00:21:42,034
[CROW] WHEN IS THIS SONG
GONNA START?

525
00:21:42,768 --> 00:21:44,270
[SERVO LAUGHS]

526
00:21:44,336 --> 00:21:46,138
[SERVO] WELL, THEY'RE
LESS BAD TONIGHT.

527
00:21:48,808 --> 00:21:50,242
[CROW] THE BATUSI!

528
00:21:54,113 --> 00:21:55,848
[SERVO] YOU AND
YOUR STUPID OVARIES.

529
00:21:55,915 --> 00:21:57,750
- [WOMAN] AAH!
- [MIKE] OW. OWIE.

530
00:21:59,051 --> 00:22:00,986
[MIKE] NEXT UP, SAM HARRIS.

531
00:22:02,321 --> 00:22:04,657
[CROW] THE WRESTLING TEAM
OF LUNT AND FONTANNE.

532
00:22:06,392 --> 00:22:08,828
[SERVO] OH, WORK YOUR MAGIC,
BOONE'S FARM.

533
00:22:10,062 --> 00:22:11,463
HEY, MARGE,
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

534
00:22:12,498 --> 00:22:14,266
JUST LEAVE ME ALONE,
WILL YOU?

535
00:22:14,600 --> 00:22:15,467
OKAY, OKAY.

536
00:22:15,534 --> 00:22:17,570
[CROW] OH, HE'S GOTTA BE GAY.
HE'S SHOWING CONCERN.

537
00:22:17,636 --> 00:22:19,672
MARGE, I WARNED YOU LAST NIGHT
TO LAY OFF THAT STUFF.

538
00:22:20,239 --> 00:22:22,374
I KNOW, I'M SORRY.

539
00:22:22,741 --> 00:22:25,444
I CAN'T RUN A NIGHT CLUB
WITH A DRUNKEN STAR.

540
00:22:26,045 --> 00:22:27,479
NOW, YOU TAKE
THE NEXT SHOW OFF.

541
00:22:27,546 --> 00:22:28,814
AND IF YOU'RE
NOT BACK IN TIME

542
00:22:28,881 --> 00:22:30,716
FOR THE THIRD SHOW
AND SOBER, YOU'RE FIRED.

543
00:22:30,783 --> 00:22:31,984
[MIKE] I'LL PUT ON YOUR FISHNETS

544
00:22:32,051 --> 00:22:33,986
AND DANCE WITH HEINZ MYSELF.

545
00:22:34,620 --> 00:22:36,789
[CROW] I'D BETTER WAX
MY JOCK STRAP AREA.

546
00:22:41,627 --> 00:22:43,863
[CROW] MAGAZINE ABOUT
THE JETSON'S DOG.

547
00:22:43,929 --> 00:22:45,130
[MIKE SIGHS]

548
00:22:45,898 --> 00:22:47,099
[MIKE] PLEASE LET US OFF.

549
00:22:47,166 --> 00:22:49,602
WE'VE BEEN ON THIS
SINCE 9:30 THIS MORNING.

550
00:22:51,270 --> 00:22:52,838
[CROW] EARLY SPACE LAUNCHES.

551
00:22:54,039 --> 00:22:56,809
[SERVO] IN THE FUTURE, WE WILL ALL
COMMUTE TO WORK THIS WAY.

552
00:22:57,977 --> 00:23:01,013
[MIKE] THIS IS A HIJACK. WE'RE TAKING
THIS ROLLER COASTER TO CUBA.

553
00:23:04,650 --> 00:23:06,151
[ALL GROAN]

554
00:23:09,021 --> 00:23:11,023
[SERVO]
<i>♪ GO CYCLON RACER, GO! ♪</i>

555
00:23:12,391 --> 00:23:13,559
[ALL GROAN AGAIN]

556
00:23:13,626 --> 00:23:15,127
[CROW] WORLD'S GREATEST RIDE

557
00:23:15,194 --> 00:23:17,496
WITHIN A FAIRLY
NARROW UNIVERSE.

558
00:23:36,615 --> 00:23:37,850
[MIKE]
SO WHAT YOU'RE SAYING, CROW,

559
00:23:37,917 --> 00:23:40,819
IS THAT USING SERVO'S HEAD
AS THE CRYSTAL BALL,

560
00:23:40,886 --> 00:23:42,588
YOU CAN TAP INTO
THE INFINITE POWER

561
00:23:42,655 --> 00:23:44,456
OF THE UNIVERSE
AND READ MY AURA,

562
00:23:44,523 --> 00:23:46,659
TELL MY FUTURE-- ALL THIS
FOR ONLY 50 CENTS?

563
00:23:46,725 --> 00:23:48,827
- EXACTLY.
- OH, I'M INTO THAT.

564
00:23:48,894 --> 00:23:50,162
GREAT, GREAT.
WELL, I PROMISE, MIKE,

565
00:23:50,229 --> 00:23:51,697
YOU WILL BE AMAZED.

566
00:23:51,764 --> 00:23:53,933
OKAY, OKAY,
UH, MUSIC, SERVO?

567
00:23:53,999 --> 00:23:55,534
WE GOTTA HAVE
THE RIGHT ATMOSPHERE.

568
00:23:55,601 --> 00:23:57,336
- [SERVO HUMS]
- OKAY.

569
00:23:57,403 --> 00:24:00,239
OKAY. WE'RE TAPPING
INTO YOUR AURA NOW.

570
00:24:00,906 --> 00:24:03,042
LIFT UP YOUR ARMS,
MICHAEL J. NELSON.

571
00:24:03,108 --> 00:24:04,710
CLOSE YOUR EYES.

572
00:24:05,311 --> 00:24:08,247
TAPPING INTO YOUR AURA NOW.

573
00:24:08,314 --> 00:24:11,984
OPEN YOURSELF UP,
LET IT FLOW OUT.

574
00:24:12,051 --> 00:24:14,887
TAPPING INTO YOUR AURA NOW.

575
00:24:14,954 --> 00:24:16,422
TAPPING INTO--

576
00:24:16,488 --> 00:24:18,824
SERVO, GRAB THE MONEY
AND RUN!

577
00:24:18,891 --> 00:24:20,793
- I CAN'T, CROW. IT'S--
- [SERVO] RUN! COME ON!

578
00:24:20,859 --> 00:24:22,127
I CAN'T RUN! YOU SEE--

579
00:24:22,194 --> 00:24:23,362
OH, YOU STUPID SON OF A--

580
00:24:23,429 --> 00:24:26,332
AAH! MIKE, YES,
WE'RE STILL TAPPING...

581
00:24:26,398 --> 00:24:27,666
TAPPING INTO THOSE

582
00:24:27,733 --> 00:24:30,202
MYSTICAL REALMS.

583
00:24:30,269 --> 00:24:33,339
<i>♪ PICTURE ME</i>
<i>UPON YOUR KNEE ♪</i>

584
00:24:33,405 --> 00:24:36,241
SO, ALL THIS...

585
00:24:36,308 --> 00:24:38,610
EVERYTHING HERE FOR,
FOR 50 CENTS?

586
00:24:38,677 --> 00:24:40,312
I KNOW, I'M SORRY.

587
00:24:40,379 --> 00:24:42,448
'CAUSE IF YOU WANT 50 CENTS,
I'LL GIVE YOU 50 CENTS.

588
00:24:42,514 --> 00:24:44,116
- YOU DON'T HAVE TO PUT CURTAINS UP.
- PLEASE DON'T, MIKE, NO.

589
00:24:44,183 --> 00:24:46,118
THIS MUST'VE TAKEN HOURS.
YOU DON'T HAVE TO DO THAT.

590
00:24:46,185 --> 00:24:48,087
- COME ON, MIKE, DON'T--
- HERE'S THE 50 CENTS RIGHT HERE.

591
00:24:48,153 --> 00:24:50,322
- OKAY.
- TAKE IT-- WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

592
00:24:50,389 --> 00:24:51,690
HEY, CROW, WE GOT THE MONEY!

593
00:24:51,757 --> 00:24:53,492
- WHOO-HOO!
- [SERVO] ALL RIGHT! SCORE, MAN!

594
00:24:56,829 --> 00:24:58,797
[SERVO] RIDE THE GIANT
MILKWEED POD.

595
00:25:00,466 --> 00:25:01,734
[CARNIVAL BARKER]
HERE YOU ARE, FOLKS.

596
00:25:01,800 --> 00:25:03,402
THE BIGGEST BARGAIN
TO HIT THE MIDWAY.

597
00:25:03,469 --> 00:25:04,870
THEY'LL THRILL YOU!
THEY'LL CHILL YOU!

598
00:25:05,137 --> 00:25:06,739
YOU'LL EVEN ASK FOR MORE.

599
00:25:06,805 --> 00:25:07,940
20 BEAUTIFUL GIRLS.

600
00:25:08,007 --> 00:25:09,341
SUPPLE AS A SERPENT.

601
00:25:09,408 --> 00:25:10,542
TWISTING, WRITHING
AND WINDING.

602
00:25:10,609 --> 00:25:12,311
[MIKE] WOW. SO, GIRLS.

603
00:25:12,378 --> 00:25:13,379
--EVER TO HIT THE MIDWAY.

604
00:25:13,445 --> 00:25:14,847
[BARKER]
THE GARDEN OF EDEN, FOLKS.

605
00:25:14,913 --> 00:25:16,615
AND NONE OF THE TREES
HAVE LEAVES.

606
00:25:16,682 --> 00:25:18,584
ADAM AND EVE
NEVER HAD IT SO GOOD.

607
00:25:18,650 --> 00:25:21,353
[SERVO] CHILDREN OF ALL AGES
WILL ENJOY OUR EXOTIC DANCERS.

608
00:25:25,357 --> 00:25:27,659
[MIKE] HOLLY GOLIGHTLY GOES
TO THE STATE FAIR.

609
00:25:30,062 --> 00:25:32,131
[SERVO] THE CRIPS, THE BLOODS,
AND MIKE.

610
00:25:32,998 --> 00:25:34,700
[CROW] HEY, I HAVE ONE OF THOSE.

611
00:25:34,767 --> 00:25:37,403
--AFTER THE SHOW,
WE RAFFLE OFF ONE OF THE GIRLS.

612
00:25:37,469 --> 00:25:38,904
YOU MAY BE THE LUCKY--

613
00:25:38,971 --> 00:25:40,806
[SERVO IN FEMININE VOICE] I'LL DO IT.
I'LL GET MY NAILS DONE.

614
00:25:44,143 --> 00:25:45,711
[SERVO] ANSWER UNCLEAR.
COME BACK LATER.

615
00:25:49,314 --> 00:25:51,383
[MIKE] WELCOME TO PURPLE CURTAIN
WAREHOUSE.

616
00:25:53,685 --> 00:25:55,921
[CROW] HELLO, POLONIUS,
ARE YOU THERE?

617
00:25:56,422 --> 00:25:57,389
HELLO?

618
00:25:59,391 --> 00:26:00,392
[SERVO GASPS]

619
00:26:01,360 --> 00:26:02,895
WELCOME, MY DEAR.

620
00:26:02,961 --> 00:26:05,097
- WON'T YOU SIT DOWN?
- THANK YOU.

621
00:26:05,164 --> 00:26:07,032
[SERVO IN FEMININE VOICE]
DO YOU MIND IF I SIT DOWN FIRST?

622
00:26:08,233 --> 00:26:11,103
[MIKE] WE TAKE VISA, MASTERCARD,
AND DEAD RATS.

623
00:26:13,505 --> 00:26:15,040
YOU WISH TO HAVE
YOUR FORTUNE TOLD?

624
00:26:15,107 --> 00:26:16,341
[SERVO] NO, I WANT MY OIL CHANGED--

625
00:26:16,408 --> 00:26:17,876
OF COURSE I WANT
MY FORTUNE TOLD!

626
00:26:18,343 --> 00:26:21,113
IT IS A THING
ONE MUST BE SURE ABOUT.

627
00:26:21,613 --> 00:26:23,715
BUT IT IS A GREAT
RESPONSIBILITY

628
00:26:23,782 --> 00:26:25,250
TO LEARN ONE'S FUTURE.

629
00:26:25,317 --> 00:26:27,352
I'M WILLING
TO TAKE A CHANCE.

630
00:26:27,419 --> 00:26:29,521
FROM THE EXPRESSION
ON YOUR FACE,

631
00:26:29,588 --> 00:26:31,657
IT WOULD SEEM TO ME
THAT YOU ARE, UH,

632
00:26:31,723 --> 00:26:33,192
SEARCHING FOR SOMETHING?

633
00:26:33,258 --> 00:26:36,395
- [CROW] YES, BOOZE.
- I'M NOT SURE WHAT IT IS.

634
00:26:36,462 --> 00:26:38,163
I ONLY KNOW
THAT SOMETHING EVIL

635
00:26:38,230 --> 00:26:39,932
LIES AHEAD FOR ME.

636
00:26:39,998 --> 00:26:41,300
[MIKE] EYDIE BUDGET GOURMET.

637
00:26:41,366 --> 00:26:44,002
ARE YOU AWARE THAT YOUR LIFE
MIGHT BE IN DANGER?

638
00:26:44,603 --> 00:26:47,606
I ONLY KNOW THAT
SOMETHING WILL HAPPEN.

639
00:26:48,340 --> 00:26:49,708
I HAVE TO KNOW WHAT.

640
00:26:49,775 --> 00:26:52,478
THEN WE MUST
CONSULT THE CARDS.

641
00:26:53,312 --> 00:26:55,848
[MIKE] SHE'S SUBLETTING
DR. CARLO LOMBARDI'S PLACE.

642
00:26:55,914 --> 00:26:59,318
THE CARDS WILL TELL US
IF WE ARE IN DANGER.

643
00:26:59,384 --> 00:27:01,253
[CROW] SHE READS
COASTERS, THEN.

644
00:27:03,188 --> 00:27:04,156
WHAT DID YOU SEE?

645
00:27:04,490 --> 00:27:06,258
[MIKE] IS THAT A WAR
OR AN AIR NOZZLE?

646
00:27:06,458 --> 00:27:07,759
I'LL LOOK FOR MYSELF.

647
00:27:08,327 --> 00:27:10,929
[SERVO] YOU WILL BE TWIRLED
BY A THIN GAY NAZI.

648
00:27:11,897 --> 00:27:13,632
THE DEATH CARD, ISN'T IT?

649
00:27:13,832 --> 00:27:15,434
- YES.
- [SERVO] EW, ICKY.

650
00:27:15,501 --> 00:27:16,535
I KNEW IT.

651
00:27:18,137 --> 00:27:19,738
I KNEW IT!

652
00:27:19,805 --> 00:27:21,073
I KNEW IT!

653
00:27:21,140 --> 00:27:22,508
- WAIT!
- [CROW] HEY-HEY!

654
00:27:22,574 --> 00:27:24,143
[CROW] HEY! WE GOT
A DINE AND DASH.

655
00:27:26,912 --> 00:27:27,946
[MIKE] PHIL NIEKRO!

656
00:27:28,147 --> 00:27:29,148
[CROW] D'OH.

657
00:27:30,115 --> 00:27:32,651
- [MONSTER GROWLS]
- [SERVO MIMICS]

658
00:27:32,718 --> 00:27:34,419
[MIKE] SOMEWHERE,
A PURSE HITS A FLOOR.

659
00:27:35,521 --> 00:27:36,922
[SERVO MIMICS
FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

660
00:27:36,989 --> 00:27:37,856
[SERVO] HEY!

661
00:27:40,192 --> 00:27:41,326
[CROW] WELL, I GUESS
WE SHOULD EXCHANGE

662
00:27:41,393 --> 00:27:42,961
INSURANCE INFORMATION, HUH?

663
00:27:46,865 --> 00:27:48,000
[SERVO] I AM INTERESTED.

664
00:27:49,801 --> 00:27:51,170
NEVER MIND, FOLKS,
JUST FORGET IT.

665
00:27:51,236 --> 00:27:52,437
JUST ONE OF THE MANY
ATTRACTIONS WE HAVE

666
00:27:52,504 --> 00:27:54,239
- GOING FOR YOU AT ALL TIMES.
- [MIKE] REALLY?

667
00:27:54,306 --> 00:27:56,008
- [SERVO] MANY ATTRACTIONS.
- WHAT'S WRONG WITH HER?

668
00:27:56,608 --> 00:27:59,211
WELL, WHATEVER SHE'S RUNNING
FROM, IT MUST BE IN THERE.

669
00:27:59,678 --> 00:28:00,846
[MONSTER GROWLS]

670
00:28:00,913 --> 00:28:02,247
[SERVO] WHO DID THAT?

671
00:28:04,183 --> 00:28:05,884
[CROW] WELL, I'M GONNA SWIPE
ALL HER CLINIQUE.

672
00:28:08,253 --> 00:28:11,023
[SERVO] THIS WILL GO WITH
ORTEGA'S CHANEL OUTFIT.

673
00:28:12,724 --> 00:28:14,126
[MONSTER GROWLS]

674
00:28:14,193 --> 00:28:17,229
[SERVO] OH, SHE'S A MEMBER OF
THE VODKA-OF-THE-MONTH CLUB.

675
00:28:19,831 --> 00:28:21,200
HEY, COME ON.

676
00:28:21,266 --> 00:28:22,701
LET'S GO IN THERE
AND GET SPOOKED, OKAY?

677
00:28:22,768 --> 00:28:24,703
YEAH, JERRY, COME ON--
LET'S GET OUR FORTUNE TOLD.

678
00:28:24,770 --> 00:28:26,905
OH, I CAN FIND A LOT BETTER WAYS
TO SPEND MY MONEY, HUH?

679
00:28:26,972 --> 00:28:28,507
COME ON. COME ON.

680
00:28:28,574 --> 00:28:30,976
- DON'T TELL ME YOU'VE--
- [ALL] EWW.

681
00:28:31,476 --> 00:28:32,578
WELL, I'LL TRY
ANYTHING ONCE.

682
00:28:32,644 --> 00:28:34,646
[SERVO] WOULD YOU LIE FACE-DOWN
ON A PORCUPINE?

683
00:28:34,713 --> 00:28:36,048
[MIKE] NO, THAT'S TERRIBLE.

684
00:28:37,115 --> 00:28:39,084
OOH, IT'S DARK IN HERE.

685
00:28:39,151 --> 00:28:40,686
[SERVO, MUFFLED] LET ME OUT
OF THIS PURSE.

686
00:28:42,554 --> 00:28:43,855
HEY, LOOK, JERRY.
A CRYSTAL BALL.

687
00:28:43,922 --> 00:28:45,023
HOW ABOUT THAT?

688
00:28:45,691 --> 00:28:46,658
SO LET'S HAVE A SEAT, HUH?

689
00:28:46,725 --> 00:28:47,893
[CROW] LET'S TELL EACH OTHER
WHAT WE'RE GONNA DO

690
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:49,828
BEFORE WE DO IT AND THEN DO IT.

691
00:28:49,895 --> 00:28:52,064
[SERVO] I THINK I'LL START WITH
THE COUNTRY OMELET.

692
00:28:56,201 --> 00:28:58,103
YOU WISH YOUR FORTUNES TOLD?

693
00:28:58,170 --> 00:28:59,972
WHAT DO YOU THINK
WE CAME HERE FOR, TO EAT?

694
00:29:00,038 --> 00:29:02,007
[SERVO WITH E. EUROPEAN ACCENT]
YOU TALK FUNNY, YOU FILTHY PIG.

695
00:29:03,875 --> 00:29:06,411
[SERVO] WELL, YOU ALL DIE
HORRIBLE DEATHS. $10.

696
00:29:08,013 --> 00:29:09,548
I'D LIKE MY FORTUNE READ.

697
00:29:09,615 --> 00:29:11,316
[CROW] AND I'D LIKE
TO SUPERSIZE IT.

698
00:29:11,750 --> 00:29:14,419
COAT MY PALM WITH SILVER.

699
00:29:15,454 --> 00:29:16,555
[MIKE] WOW, HE LOOKS LIKE
NOSFERATU.

700
00:29:16,622 --> 00:29:18,090
OKAY, HOW MUCH?

701
00:29:18,156 --> 00:29:19,524
50 CENTS.

702
00:29:19,858 --> 00:29:23,228
[SERVO] YEP, LET ME GET MY CONDOM
OUT OF THE WAY, HERE.

703
00:29:23,295 --> 00:29:24,563
IT'S A MAGNUM, YOU KNOW?

704
00:29:25,430 --> 00:29:29,034
- THANK YOU.
- GIVE ME YOUR PALM, PLEASE.

705
00:29:29,101 --> 00:29:30,168
[SERVO WITH E. EUROPEAN ACCENT]
YOU HAVE A BIG HOUSE AND--

706
00:29:30,235 --> 00:29:31,803
[SPITS] THERE'S THE SWIMMING POOL!

707
00:29:31,870 --> 00:29:35,107
[MADAM ESTRELLA] MM, YOU ARE VERY
FORTUNATE YOUNG LADY.

708
00:29:35,173 --> 00:29:37,409
YOU ARE GOING
TO BE LUCKY IN LOVE.

709
00:29:37,476 --> 00:29:39,745
I SEE ONLY ONE HUSBAND
FOR YOU.

710
00:29:39,811 --> 00:29:42,481
THESE DAYS,
THAT'S A REMARKABLE THING, HUH?

711
00:29:43,282 --> 00:29:44,549
YOU ARE GOING TO BE RICH,

712
00:29:44,616 --> 00:29:46,785
IF YOU ARE NOT ALREADY, SO...

713
00:29:46,852 --> 00:29:48,987
I SEE THAT YOUR MOTHER

714
00:29:49,054 --> 00:29:50,722
WILL NOT APPROVE OF THE MAN

715
00:29:50,789 --> 00:29:51,923
YOU PICK FOR A HUSBAND.

716
00:29:51,990 --> 00:29:53,959
[CROW] D'UH, THAT'S ME, HONEY.

717
00:29:54,026 --> 00:29:56,495
OKAY, WHEN ARE YOU GONNA
USE THE FISH BOWL?

718
00:29:56,561 --> 00:29:58,330
I USE BOTH THE CRYSTAL

719
00:29:58,397 --> 00:30:00,532
AND THE PALM
FOR MY READINGS.

720
00:30:01,333 --> 00:30:03,869
CRYSTAL SHOWS
THE IMMEDIATE FUTURE.

721
00:30:05,037 --> 00:30:07,806
THE PALM SHOWS THE INDICATION
OF ONE'S ENTIRE LIFE.

722
00:30:07,873 --> 00:30:09,207
[SERVO] IT'S A TWO-PRONGED
FORTUNE ATTACK.

723
00:30:09,274 --> 00:30:12,511
THE USE OF THE CRYSTAL
IS VERY DANGEROUS.

724
00:30:12,744 --> 00:30:13,979
WELL, WHY DO YOU SAY THAT?

725
00:30:14,746 --> 00:30:17,282
SOMETIMES THE CRYSTAL
SEES THINGS

726
00:30:17,949 --> 00:30:19,751
THAT IT IS BETTER

727
00:30:19,818 --> 00:30:21,720
WE DO NOT KNOW.

728
00:30:22,754 --> 00:30:24,589
[MIKE] ANYWAY, ABOUT
YOUR FORTUNES.

729
00:30:25,424 --> 00:30:27,426
[CROW] AH, I'M GETTING
A C:\ PROMPT. HOLD ON.

730
00:30:29,861 --> 00:30:32,497
[SERVO] OH, NO, OH, JEEZ,
OH MY GOD!

731
00:30:32,564 --> 00:30:35,100
- [CROW] UH-HUH?
- [MUMBLES FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

732
00:30:35,167 --> 00:30:36,468
[CROW] IT WOULDN'T BE JERRY.

733
00:30:36,968 --> 00:30:38,003
[SERVO] HANG ON.

734
00:30:38,070 --> 00:30:39,338
WHAT DO YOU SEE?

735
00:30:39,404 --> 00:30:41,173
I SEE MUCH UNHAPPINESS

736
00:30:41,239 --> 00:30:43,575
FOR YOU IN THE NEAR FUTURE.

737
00:30:43,642 --> 00:30:45,877
SOMEONE WHO IS NEAR TO YOU...

738
00:30:45,944 --> 00:30:48,580
- [SERVO SMOOCHES]
- ...IS GOING TO DIE.

739
00:30:48,647 --> 00:30:49,748
OH, COME ON, NOW.

740
00:30:50,749 --> 00:30:52,984
THE CRYSTAL DOES NOT LIE.

741
00:30:53,051 --> 00:30:54,453
WHAT THE CRYSTAL SEES...

742
00:30:54,519 --> 00:30:56,121
[CROW] THE CRYSTAL GETS.

743
00:30:56,488 --> 00:30:57,723
...IT REVEALS.

744
00:30:59,725 --> 00:31:02,160
[MIKE] AND THE DIRECTOR
DIGS OUT AN EYE BOOGER.

745
00:31:03,995 --> 00:31:05,497
[ESTRELLA] I SEE...

746
00:31:06,698 --> 00:31:07,933
SOMEONE...

747
00:31:09,601 --> 00:31:11,203
- YES...
- [SERVO] YES...

748
00:31:11,269 --> 00:31:12,537
IT IS YOU.

749
00:31:12,604 --> 00:31:14,106
[SERVO] YES, I SEE AN OILY
FORTUNE-TELLER--

750
00:31:14,172 --> 00:31:15,941
- [SERVO] OH, THAT'S ME.
- BY WATER.

751
00:31:17,843 --> 00:31:18,944
[ESTRELLA] NOW...

752
00:31:20,078 --> 00:31:21,580
I SEE A MAN...

753
00:31:22,714 --> 00:31:24,616
I CAN NO LONGER SEE YOU.

754
00:31:24,683 --> 00:31:25,817
[SERVO] UH-HUH. SURE.

755
00:31:26,651 --> 00:31:28,320
- NOW--
- [SERVO] YEAH. SURE. SOUNDS GOOD.

756
00:31:28,387 --> 00:31:29,821
--MOVES...

757
00:31:31,123 --> 00:31:33,358
[CROW] COULD YOU MOVE
THIS ALONG, PLEASE? THANKS.

758
00:31:33,692 --> 00:31:35,961
[ESTRELLA] YOU ARE LYING
ON THE GROUND.

759
00:31:37,596 --> 00:31:39,097
BY WATER.

760
00:31:40,599 --> 00:31:42,200
I CAN NO LONGER
SEE ANYTHING ELSE.

761
00:31:42,267 --> 00:31:43,502
[SERVO] THIS OFFER EXPIRES
IN SIX MONTHS.

762
00:31:43,568 --> 00:31:45,704
FUTURE NOT VALID
IN UTAH OR ALASKA.

763
00:31:45,771 --> 00:31:47,305
WELL, NOW THAT YOU'VE
READ HER FORTUNE,

764
00:31:47,372 --> 00:31:48,640
WHY DON'T YOU TELL ME MINE?

765
00:31:48,707 --> 00:31:50,809
[CROW] IT DOESN'T WORK
ON FERRETS, OKAY?

766
00:31:50,876 --> 00:31:52,811
THERE IS NOTHING
I CAN TELL YOU.

767
00:31:52,878 --> 00:31:54,112
WHY CAN'T YOU READ MINE?

768
00:31:54,579 --> 00:31:56,214
[SERVO] FIRST YOU HAVE
TO HAVE ONE.

769
00:31:56,281 --> 00:31:58,984
THERE ARE SOME
WHO CANNOT BE READ.

770
00:31:59,050 --> 00:32:01,353
THEIR LIFE IS BUT A SHADOW
IN THE CRYSTAL.

771
00:32:01,420 --> 00:32:02,654
[MIKE] UH... DUH...

772
00:32:02,721 --> 00:32:05,157
YOU ARE SUCH A PERSON.

773
00:32:05,557 --> 00:32:07,626
COME ON, NOW.
TELL ME MINE, WILL YA?

774
00:32:07,692 --> 00:32:10,095
I CANNOT TELL YOU
ANYTHING ELSE NOW.

775
00:32:10,162 --> 00:32:12,164
I THINK YOU CLUTTERED UP
HER CRYSTAL BALL.

776
00:32:12,531 --> 00:32:13,899
[MIKE] SHE'S GOT A PET TICK.

777
00:32:13,965 --> 00:32:16,334
CLOUDS AFFECT
ONLY THE CLOUDY.

778
00:32:16,401 --> 00:32:19,004
- [CROW] IT IS CLOUD LAW.
- WHATEVER THE IMAGE.

779
00:32:19,671 --> 00:32:21,139
[SERVO] YOU'VE GOT MAIL.

780
00:32:22,741 --> 00:32:25,143
WHY DON'T YOU COME BACK SOME
OTHER TIME, JERRY, HUH?

781
00:32:25,210 --> 00:32:26,745
SURE. I'LL COME BACK AGAIN.

782
00:32:26,812 --> 00:32:28,079
YOU CAN BET ON THAT.

783
00:32:28,146 --> 00:32:30,449
I WILL CHARGE YOU
ONLY FOR THE YOUNG LADY.

784
00:32:30,515 --> 00:32:31,783
YOU BET YOU WILL.

785
00:32:31,850 --> 00:32:34,653
[CROW] LOOK, YOU WANNA TALK
TO MY SUPERVISOR, SIR?

786
00:32:34,719 --> 00:32:36,621
WHICH IS THE WAY
OUT OF HERE?

787
00:32:36,688 --> 00:32:39,357
- THAT WAY.
- COME ON.

788
00:32:39,424 --> 00:32:41,092
[SERVO] DO YOU HAVE
A FUTURE PUNCH CARD?

789
00:32:41,159 --> 00:32:42,360
DO YOU WANT ONE?

790
00:32:43,428 --> 00:32:45,931
BOY, I DON'T WANNA
GET LOST IN THIS PLACE.

791
00:32:46,498 --> 00:32:49,034
[SERVO] SHE'D BETTER GET READY.
NANCY REAGAN HAS AN APPOINTMENT.

792
00:32:52,804 --> 00:32:54,840
ALL RIGHT, FOLKS,
STEP UP AND SEE OUR SHOW.

793
00:32:54,906 --> 00:32:56,741
WE HAVE GIRLS, GIRLS,
AND GIRLS.

794
00:32:56,808 --> 00:32:58,143
[SERVO] AND A HAMSTER.

795
00:32:58,877 --> 00:33:00,745
COME ON, STEP RIGHT UP HERE
AND SEE OUR SHOW--

796
00:33:00,812 --> 00:33:02,247
OKAY, NOW THAT YOU'VE HAD
YOUR FORTUNE TOLD,

797
00:33:02,314 --> 00:33:03,682
WHAT DO YOU SAY
WE GO OVER THERE AND GO INSIDE,

798
00:33:03,748 --> 00:33:04,716
LOOK AT THE GIRLS?

799
00:33:04,783 --> 00:33:06,718
[CROW] OH, YOU THINK
THEY HAVE GIRLS?

800
00:33:07,652 --> 00:33:09,387
OH, I--
I'D RATHER NOT, JERRY.

801
00:33:09,454 --> 00:33:11,089
WHY DON'T WE GO
TO THE FUNHOUSE INSTEAD?

802
00:33:11,156 --> 00:33:12,524
OH, COME ON, ANGEL.

803
00:33:12,591 --> 00:33:14,659
LET'S-- LET'S JUST STICK AROUND
A LITTLE WHILE, HUH?

804
00:33:14,726 --> 00:33:16,027
YEAH, THAT'S
A GOOD IDEA, ANGIE.

805
00:33:16,094 --> 00:33:17,863
- [SERVO] RENT-A-BALKI.
- ALL RIGHT. ALL RIGHT.

806
00:33:17,929 --> 00:33:18,997
JUST FOR A FEW MINUTES.

807
00:33:20,398 --> 00:33:21,399
[ESTRELLA] ORTEGA?

808
00:33:21,466 --> 00:33:23,001
[SERVO] YOU WANNA HIT
A MOVIE TONIGHT?

809
00:33:23,935 --> 00:33:25,871
TELL MY SISTER CARMELITA

810
00:33:25,937 --> 00:33:27,772
THAT THE TIME
HAS COME, YEAH?

811
00:33:27,839 --> 00:33:29,541
[CROW] YES, OF COURSE, MADAM.

812
00:33:29,608 --> 00:33:31,343
[SERVO] SOMEHOW,
THEIR MARRIAGE WORKS.

813
00:33:33,144 --> 00:33:35,180
STELLA, STEP FORWARD AND GIVE
THE FOLKS A LITTLE SAMPLE.

814
00:33:35,247 --> 00:33:37,949
[SERVO] SEE THE DUMPY WOMAN
WITH THE DR. SEUSS HAT ON!

815
00:33:38,016 --> 00:33:39,851
[BARKER] THAT'S ENOUGH FOLKS...

816
00:33:39,918 --> 00:33:41,620
AND HOW ABOUT
A LITTLE FROM YOU?

817
00:33:41,686 --> 00:33:43,622
[CROW] SHOTS RING OUT,
BUT THE PEOPLE OF BOSNIA

818
00:33:43,688 --> 00:33:45,357
BRAVELY GO ON WITH
THEIR PEEP SHOWS.

819
00:33:47,926 --> 00:33:49,828
[SERVO WITH SLURRED VOICE]
YEAH, I'M DRUNK-- SO WHAT?

820
00:33:50,996 --> 00:33:52,631
THAT'S IT. TAKE IT EASY.

821
00:33:52,697 --> 00:33:54,466
- WE HAVE 20 BEAUTIFUL GIRLS.
- [SERVO MIMICS FOREIGN LANGUAGE]

822
00:33:54,533 --> 00:33:56,201
[BARKER] AND ONLY
10 BEAUTIFUL CUSTOMERS.

823
00:33:56,268 --> 00:33:57,736
[SERVO] THAT FROSTS MY PERM.

824
00:33:57,802 --> 00:34:00,238
AND NOW, FOLKS, I WANNA
GIVE YOU A GLIMPSE OF OUR STAR.

825
00:34:00,305 --> 00:34:02,274
THAT EXOTIC GYPSY DANCER,

826
00:34:02,340 --> 00:34:03,508
CARMELITA!

827
00:34:03,575 --> 00:34:05,577
[SERVO] CARMELITA,
THAT GOOEY CHOCOLATE!

828
00:34:05,644 --> 00:34:08,179
[CROW] CARMELITA, SINGING
THE SONGS OF LEONARD COHEN.

829
00:34:08,246 --> 00:34:09,314
[SERVO LAUGHS]

830
00:34:12,050 --> 00:34:13,485
[MIKE] AUSTRALOPITHECUS.

831
00:34:16,755 --> 00:34:19,224
[SERVO WITH DEEP VOICE]
THE RAT HAD BABIES AGAIN, MA'AM.

832
00:34:21,927 --> 00:34:23,461
[CROW] HE NEEDS SOMETHING
TO GNAW ON.

833
00:34:24,629 --> 00:34:26,831
[MIKE] AWKWARD FOR SOME REASON.

834
00:34:26,898 --> 00:34:28,300
[SERVO] A CAVALCADE OF HEADS

835
00:34:28,366 --> 00:34:30,168
FROM THE EARLY 60'S, I GUESS.

836
00:34:30,869 --> 00:34:33,505
[CROW] EVEN THE NORMALLY-SHARP
ORTEGA SEEMS CONFUSED.

837
00:34:33,572 --> 00:34:36,308
[BARKER] JUST LOOK AT THOSE
DARK, DREAMY EYES.

838
00:34:36,374 --> 00:34:38,710
THOSE LIPS, AND THAT BODY.

839
00:34:38,777 --> 00:34:39,711
WHAT A BODY.

840
00:34:39,778 --> 00:34:41,780
[MIKE] THIS WHOLE MOVIE
HAS AN OILY T-ZONE.

841
00:34:42,280 --> 00:34:44,049
--SEE THAT BODY IN ACTION.

842
00:34:45,216 --> 00:34:47,953
[SERVO] A MOVIE THAT DARES
TO SHOW YOU EVERY PORE.

843
00:34:48,386 --> 00:34:50,522
[BARKER] COME INSIDE AND SEE
THE ONE AND ONLY

844
00:34:50,588 --> 00:34:51,890
WOMAN OF MYSTERY.

845
00:34:52,357 --> 00:34:53,625
[SERVO] SO, GREAT ACT, HUH?

846
00:34:53,692 --> 00:34:54,960
THAT'S HER, FOLKS.
THAT'S JUST A GLIMPSE

847
00:34:55,026 --> 00:34:56,227
OF OUR BIG ATTRACTION.

848
00:34:56,294 --> 00:34:58,964
[CROW] LET'S GO,
<i>MASTERPIECE THEATER </i>IS ON.

849
00:35:01,766 --> 00:35:04,135
[MIKE] PHOEBE CATES,
ON SALE TODAY.

850
00:35:04,202 --> 00:35:07,539
[SERVO] SUDDENLY, A GIANT GIRL SNAPS
HER TETHER AND KILLS A COOLIE!

851
