- [CROW] I GAINED AN OUNCE!

1484
01:01:25,582 --> 01:01:27,250
[SERVO] WHO WANTS CHEESE
ON THEIR BURGERS?

1485
01:01:29,786 --> 01:01:31,454
[MIKE] DID THEY JUST DO
PHASER SHOTS?

1486
01:01:34,024 --> 01:01:34,991
[SERVO] MADISON!

1487
01:01:38,929 --> 01:01:40,063
[CROW] KIDS, CAN SOMEONE
COME OVER HERE

1488
01:01:40,130 --> 01:01:41,298
AND HELP ME PURGE?

1489
01:01:43,033 --> 01:01:44,801
[SERVO] YOU'RE TOTALLY MENTAL,
I MUST SAY.

1490
01:01:47,304 --> 01:01:49,272
- [SERVO] HUH? WHAT?
- [CROW] HUH?

1491
01:01:49,339 --> 01:01:51,174
[MIKE] LATER, IN ROME.

1492
01:01:51,942 --> 01:01:53,810
[CROW] THE SLIGHTLY "L."

1493
01:01:55,212 --> 01:01:57,347
<i>♪♪♪ [COUNTRY SONG]</i>

1494
01:01:57,414 --> 01:02:00,951
[SERVO] ♪ KEEP THOSE
<i>DOGGIES ROLLIN' ♪</i>

1495
01:02:03,320 --> 01:02:06,189
[SERVO MIMICS HORSE HOOFS]

1496
01:02:06,256 --> 01:02:07,424
[WHIP CRACK]

1497
01:02:07,490 --> 01:02:09,559
[MIKE] THIS WAS DIGITALLY RECORDED,
THEN ERASED.

1498
01:02:09,626 --> 01:02:12,095
THEN RE-RECORDED ON
A DICTAPHONE.

1499
01:02:12,696 --> 01:02:14,864
[CROW] SO ARE THEY IMPLYING
THERE'S A COUNTRY-MUSIC FEST

1500
01:02:14,931 --> 01:02:16,733
HAPPENING, LIKE,
A MILE AWAY?

1501
01:02:19,369 --> 01:02:21,972
[SERVO]<i> ♪ NIGHT TRAIN... ♪</i>

1502
01:02:22,038 --> 01:02:26,309
<i>♪ TO MUNDO FEMALE ♪</i>

1503
01:02:27,043 --> 01:02:28,345
[MIKE] WESTERN ZOMBIE MUSIC.

1504
01:02:28,411 --> 01:02:29,980
A SHORT-LIVED FAD.

1505
01:02:31,581 --> 01:02:32,549
[CROW] HI.

1506
01:02:33,416 --> 01:02:35,218
[SERVO] TRAINS MAKE ME
THINK OF SOMETHING.

1507
01:02:37,053 --> 01:02:38,622
[CROW] BUT RICE-A-RONI SHIPMENTS

1508
01:02:38,688 --> 01:02:40,590
CONTINUED THROUGH THE CRISIS.

1509
01:02:43,693 --> 01:02:45,695
[MIKE] I DIDN'T KNOW THAT EDISON
WROTE AND RECORDED

1510
01:02:45,762 --> 01:02:47,397
HIS OWN FOLK SONGS.

1511
01:02:47,964 --> 01:02:49,266
[SERVO] YOU KNOW, THEY USED
TO PUT THE MICROPHONE

1512
01:02:49,332 --> 01:02:51,501
IN A SALTINE BOX
ACROSS THE ROOM.

1513
01:02:52,902 --> 01:02:55,038
[CROW] HEY, I THINK I'LL SAVE VOMITING
TILL I GET HOME.

1514
01:02:55,805 --> 01:02:57,674
[MIKE] MAYBE IT'S THE FUNK
OF THE HOODED SWEATSHIRT

1515
01:02:57,741 --> 01:02:59,409
HE'S BEEN WEARING
THROUGH THE WHOLE FILM

1516
01:02:59,476 --> 01:03:00,744
THAT'S GOT HIM DOWN.

1517
01:03:02,045 --> 01:03:03,413
[SERVO] WAIT, SHH,
I LOVE THIS VERSE.

1518
01:03:03,480 --> 01:03:06,216
HE SINGS... [MUFFLED]

1519
01:03:11,988 --> 01:03:13,990
- [CROW] HMM. HI.
- [SERVO] HI.

1520
01:03:14,691 --> 01:03:15,625
[MAN] WE INTERRUPT THIS PROGRAM

1521
01:03:15,692 --> 01:03:16,660
<i>TO BRING YOU A SPECIAL</i>
<i>ANNOUNCEMENT.</i>

1522
01:03:16,726 --> 01:03:17,861
[SERVO] THIS IS HERBIE THE MISFIT ELF.

1523
01:03:17,927 --> 01:03:19,629
<i>POLICE ARE STILL SEARCHING</i>
<i>FOR THE BIZARRE MURDERER</i>

1524
01:03:19,696 --> 01:03:20,964
<i>OF MARGE NEILSON,</i>

1525
01:03:21,031 --> 01:03:23,400
<i>EXOTIC DANCER AT</i>
<i>THE HUNGRY MOUTH NIGHT CLUB.</i>

1526
01:03:23,466 --> 01:03:25,402
<i>MS. NEILSON WAS</i>
<i>STABBED TO DEATH LAST NIGHT</i>

1527
01:03:25,468 --> 01:03:27,370
<i>DURING THE PERFORMANCE</i>
<i>OF HER ACT.</i>

1528
01:03:27,437 --> 01:03:29,839
<i>HER PARTNER, BILL WARD,</i>
<i>WAS FATALLY WOUNDED</i>

1529
01:03:29,906 --> 01:03:32,008
<i>WHILE TRYING</i>
<i>TO APPREHEND THE MURDERER.</i>

1530
01:03:32,075 --> 01:03:33,877
<i>POLICE HAVE NO</i>
<i>DESCRIPTION OF THE KILLER,</i>

1531
01:03:33,943 --> 01:03:35,145
<i>BUT THEY ARE,</i>
<i>AT PRESENT, CHECKING</i>

1532
01:03:35,211 --> 01:03:36,880
<i>ALL TRANSIENTS IN THE AREA.</i>

1533
01:03:36,946 --> 01:03:39,382
[MIKE AS JIM CARREY]
ALRIGHTY THEN!

1534
01:03:40,216 --> 01:03:42,485
<i>WE NOW RETURN YOU</i>
<i>TO OUR MUSICAL PROGRAM.</i>

1535
01:03:42,552 --> 01:03:44,788
[CROW] DURING OUR NEWS BREAK,
WE CHANGED STATION FORMAT

1536
01:03:44,854 --> 01:03:47,057
TO ALL-TRUMPET FANFARE.

1537
01:03:50,026 --> 01:03:52,028
[SERVO] SUDDENLY IT'S
<i>THE TOWN WITHOUT PITY.</i>

1538
01:03:54,531 --> 01:03:56,866
[MIKE] I'M A ZOMBIE.
THIS IS MY STORY.

1539
01:03:59,269 --> 01:04:00,637
[CROW] OH GOD,
THE CENTRIFUGAL FORCE!

1540
01:04:00,704 --> 01:04:02,372
MOMMY! MOMMY!

1541
01:04:03,840 --> 01:04:06,142
[SERVO] RIDE... THE LAMP.

1542
01:04:06,209 --> 01:04:07,344
[MIKE] OKAY, THERE'S A FAIR

1543
01:04:07,410 --> 01:04:09,846
THAT FIGURES PROMINENTLY
IN THE MOVIE. WE KNOW!

1544
01:04:09,913 --> 01:04:11,214
[BARKER] STEP RIGHT UP!
JOIN THE SHOW!

1545
01:04:11,281 --> 01:04:13,149
ONE THIN DIME,
ONE THIN TENTH OF A DOLLAR

1546
01:04:13,216 --> 01:04:14,617
WILL GET YOU IN TO SEE
SOME OF THE MOST

1547
01:04:14,684 --> 01:04:16,820
- EXOTIC-LOOKING LADIES--
- [CROW] GET TOUCHED BY A CARNY!

1548
01:04:16,886 --> 01:04:18,688
STEP RIGHT OVER THERE
TO GET TICKETS.

1549
01:04:18,755 --> 01:04:20,357
ONE THIN DIME.
THAT'S ALL IT COSTS.

1550
01:04:20,423 --> 01:04:22,926
[SERVO] ONE THIN DIME-- THEY ARE THIN.
HE MAKES A GOOD POINT.

1551
01:04:22,992 --> 01:04:24,194
[BARKER] THE GIRLS OF THE MIDWAY

1552
01:04:24,260 --> 01:04:25,695
JOINING FORCES TO BRING YOU

1553
01:04:25,762 --> 01:04:27,330
SONG AND DANCE...

1554
01:04:27,397 --> 01:04:28,898
[CROW] MR. HERMAN.

1555
01:04:28,965 --> 01:04:31,334
<i>♪ I COME HOME AND IT'S AFTER 12 ♪</i>

1556
01:04:31,401 --> 01:04:33,136
<i>♪ MAMA'S MAYBE UP TO GET ME ♪</i>

1557
01:04:33,203 --> 01:04:35,071
<i>♪ WELL, SHE GETS HER SHICK</i>
<i>OUT OF SHAPE ♪</i>

1558
01:04:35,138 --> 01:04:36,706
[CROW] SHRIMP OUT OF SHAKE?

1559
01:04:37,774 --> 01:04:39,843
[SERVO] SCHICK OUT OF SHAPE? OKAY.

1560
01:04:43,913 --> 01:04:45,749
[MIKE] I THINK THIS IS A CAN-CAN'T.

1561
01:04:45,815 --> 01:04:48,118
<i>♪ DADDY'S LITTLE GIRL</i>
<i>WHERE HAVE YOU BEEN ♪</i>

1562
01:04:48,184 --> 01:04:50,620
<i>♪ YOU SHOULD'VE BEEN HOME</i>
<i>ABOUT HALF PAST TEN ♪</i>

1563
01:04:50,687 --> 01:04:52,389
<i>♪ SHE GETS HER SHICK OUT OF SHAPE ♪</i>

1564
01:04:52,455 --> 01:04:53,523
WELL THEN, TRY GILLETTE!

1565
01:04:55,325 --> 01:04:56,993
[ALL THREE]
<i>♪ GET YOUR SCHICK OUT OF SHAPE ♪</i>

1566
01:05:00,463 --> 01:05:02,365
[SERVO] JULIE EISENHOWER
LIKE YOU'VE NEVER SEEN HER.

1567
01:05:02,465 --> 01:05:03,733
<i>♪ HER FEET START</i>
<i>TO TREMBLE ♪</i>

1568
01:05:03,800 --> 01:05:05,235
<i>♪ AND SHE SHAKES HER FIST ♪</i>

1569
01:05:05,301 --> 01:05:08,071
<i>♪ HER MAMA'S WINDING UP</i>
<i>TO DO THE TWIST ♪</i>

1570
01:05:08,138 --> 01:05:10,306
[SERVO] SO WHAT DO
THE HUGE-PLUMAGE BIRD WOMEN

1571
01:05:10,373 --> 01:05:11,908
HAVE TO DO WITH
SCHICK OUT OF SHAPE?

1572
01:05:11,975 --> 01:05:12,976
[MIKE LAUGHS]

1573
01:05:13,910 --> 01:05:16,746
<i>♪ LITTLE GIRL</i>
<i>RAISED TO KNOW ♪</i>

1574
01:05:16,813 --> 01:05:18,982
<i>♪ DO AS I TELL</i>
<i>AND YOU GO-GO-GO ♪</i>

1575
01:05:19,048 --> 01:05:20,116
[SERVO] WHOO!

1576
01:05:20,183 --> 01:05:22,085
SHE'S THE HARDEST-WORKING
DENTAL HYGIENIST

1577
01:05:22,152 --> 01:05:23,119
IN SHOW BUSINESS.

1578
01:05:25,355 --> 01:05:26,589
[SERVO]<i> ♪ FIRST BLADE LIFTS ♪</i>

1579
01:05:26,656 --> 01:05:27,824
<i>♪ THE SECOND ONE CUTS ♪</i>

1580
01:05:27,891 --> 01:05:29,826
[ALL] ♪ YOU GET YOUR
<i>SCHICK OUT OF SHAPE ♪</i>

1581
01:05:29,893 --> 01:05:32,695
[SERVO] NOW, EVERYBODY, SHAVE!

1582
01:05:32,762 --> 01:05:34,364
[CROW] REPLACE YOUR BLADE
EVERY TWO WEEKS!

1583
01:05:34,431 --> 01:05:35,698
[MIKE] NO NICKS OR CUTS!

1584
01:05:35,765 --> 01:05:37,734
COMFORT AND CONVENIENCE!

1585
01:05:37,801 --> 01:05:38,935
[SERVO] WHOO!

1586
01:05:42,238 --> 01:05:43,840
[SERVO] OOH, I LET ONE.

1587
01:05:48,344 --> 01:05:49,479
<i>♪ HER FEET START</i>
<i>TO TREMBLE ♪</i>

1588
01:05:49,546 --> 01:05:51,247
[SERVO] OH, OOPS, WE'RE ON AGAIN.

1589
01:05:51,314 --> 01:05:53,783
<i>♪ HER MAMA'S WINDING UP</i>
<i>TO DO THE TWIST ♪</i>

1590
01:05:53,883 --> 01:05:56,553
[SERVO] THIS IS WHERE THE DANCING
GETS GREAT-- THE TIMING.

1591
01:05:56,619 --> 01:05:58,988
[MIKE] GOWER CHAMPION IS
IN THE CORNER TREMBLING.

1592
01:05:59,989 --> 01:06:01,491
<i>♪ DADDY'S LITTLE GIRL ♪</i>

1593
01:06:01,558 --> 01:06:03,293
[SERVO] OKAY, WAIT,

1594
01:06:03,359 --> 01:06:05,695
- [SERVO] SHOULD WE GO THIS WAY--
- [CROW] OVER HERE, YOU GO LEFT--

1595
01:06:07,964 --> 01:06:09,799
- [SERVO] WHERE DO WE GO--
- [CROW] THIS WAY, CINDY,

1596
01:06:09,866 --> 01:06:11,568
- WHAT ARE YOU DOING--
- NO, STOP.

1597
01:06:13,036 --> 01:06:14,671
[CROW] YEAH, NEVER LET
YOUR BOOK CLUB

1598
01:06:14,737 --> 01:06:16,573
BE BACKUP DANCERS, I SAY.

1599
01:06:17,240 --> 01:06:19,642
♪♪♪ [SINGS INDISTINCTLY]

1600
01:06:19,709 --> 01:06:21,077
<i>♪ SHE GETS HER SHICK OUT OF SHAPE ♪</i>

1601
01:06:22,345 --> 01:06:24,147
[MIKE] BROUGHT TO YOU BY SCHICK.

1602
01:06:26,316 --> 01:06:28,251
[SERVO IN FEMALE VOICE] GOSH,
YOU KNOW, I ADVISE OTHER PEOPLE

1603
01:06:28,318 --> 01:06:29,719
TO GET THEIR
SCHICK OUT OF SHAPE,

1604
01:06:29,786 --> 01:06:31,955
BUT MY SCHICK IS
NOWHERE NEAR OUT OF SHAPE.

1605
01:06:32,021 --> 01:06:33,056
[MIKE LAUGHS]

1606
01:06:35,258 --> 01:06:37,727
[CROW] PRANCER MURDERED.
DANCER HELD FOR QUESTIONING.

1607
01:06:43,800 --> 01:06:45,668
[MIKE] DO YOU TAKE MURDER
WALK-INS?

1608
01:06:46,302 --> 01:06:48,538
- YOO-HOO?
- [CROW] CAN I GET A YOO-HOO?

1609
01:06:48,872 --> 01:06:49,973
HELLO?

1610
01:06:51,741 --> 01:06:53,276
[SERVO] JUST TENDING MY MOLES.

1611
01:06:53,343 --> 01:06:54,978
IF YOU'RE LOOKING FOR
MY SISTER, CARMELITA,

1612
01:06:55,044 --> 01:06:56,045
SHE'S NOT HERE.

1613
01:06:56,112 --> 01:06:57,413
I WASN'T LOOKING FOR
CARMELITA.

1614
01:06:57,480 --> 01:06:58,882
I WAS LOOKING FOR YOU.

1615
01:06:58,948 --> 01:07:00,450
[MIKE] ARE YOU THE TICK VET?

1616
01:07:00,917 --> 01:07:03,052
- WHY?
- HAVE YOU SEEN THIS?

1617
01:07:04,621 --> 01:07:07,156
[CROW] I SEE THAT FILTHY PIG
FUTURES ARE DOWN!

1618
01:07:07,223 --> 01:07:08,358
WHAT ABOUT IT?

1619
01:07:08,424 --> 01:07:09,893
SHE WAS IN YOUR TENT
LAST NIGHT.

1620
01:07:09,959 --> 01:07:11,394
WAS SHE? I DON'T REMEMBER.

1621
01:07:12,061 --> 01:07:13,763
I WOULDN'T HAVE
REMEMBERED EITHER.

1622
01:07:13,830 --> 01:07:15,865
IF IT WASN'T THE WAY
SHE LOOKED WHEN SHE LEFT.

1623
01:07:15,932 --> 01:07:17,500
SHE SEEMED TERRIFIED.

1624
01:07:17,567 --> 01:07:19,702
- DID SHE?
- YES.

1625
01:07:20,169 --> 01:07:21,771
SOMETHING
HAD TO OF HAPPENED.

1626
01:07:21,838 --> 01:07:23,439
HERE TODAY, GONE TOMORROW.

1627
01:07:23,506 --> 01:07:25,041
[MIKE] SCHICK OUT OF SHAPE,
YOU KNOW.

1628
01:07:25,108 --> 01:07:26,643
JUST OUT OF CURIOSITY,

1629
01:07:26,709 --> 01:07:29,012
WHAT DID YOU PREDICT
THE FUTURE HAD FOR HER?

1630
01:07:30,046 --> 01:07:31,714
- NOTHING.
- [SERVO] I KNOW NOTHING!

1631
01:07:31,781 --> 01:07:33,683
BECAUSE SHE WASN'T HERE
LAST NIGHT.

1632
01:07:34,784 --> 01:07:36,286
IF I DIDN'T KNOW YOU BETTER,

1633
01:07:36,352 --> 01:07:38,021
I'D ALMOST SAY
YOU HAD SOMETHING TO HIDE.

1634
01:07:38,087 --> 01:07:39,355
[MIKE] MIGHT START WITH THE MOLE.

1635
01:07:39,422 --> 01:07:40,857
BUT I'VE GOT TO GET HOME.

1636
01:07:40,924 --> 01:07:41,991
I'VE GOT A DATE.

1637
01:07:43,860 --> 01:07:45,528
[CROW] WITH A CARNY!

1638
01:07:50,033 --> 01:07:52,468
[MALE EMCEE] AND NOW WE GIVE YOU
THE GIRL WITH THE GOLDEN VOICE,

1639
01:07:52,535 --> 01:07:53,903
MS. KERRY RANDALL.

1640
01:07:54,971 --> 01:07:56,639
[SERVO]<i> ♪ GILLETTE, THE BEST ♪</i>

1641
01:07:56,706 --> 01:07:58,942
<i>♪ A MAN CAN GET ♪</i>

1642
01:07:59,042 --> 01:08:00,443
[KERRY SCATTING]

1643
01:08:00,543 --> 01:08:02,579
[MIKE] HELLO, HEY, MILES DAVIS.

1644
01:08:02,645 --> 01:08:03,813
TURN AROUND.

1645
01:08:06,149 --> 01:08:08,985
[CROW] HER SCATTING PUTS
ELLA FITZGERALD'S TO SHAME.

1646
01:08:09,185 --> 01:08:10,920
[MIKE] I THINK OF A DIFFERENT
KIND OF SCAT

1647
01:08:10,987 --> 01:08:12,155
WHEN I HEAR HER SING.

1648
01:08:13,056 --> 01:08:14,057
[SERVO] WHOO.

1649
01:08:14,591 --> 01:08:16,426
SHE'S LIKE RUE GRETZKY.

1650
01:08:17,126 --> 01:08:19,529
[CROW] LADIES AND GENTLEMEN,
THE GLENN CLOSE EXPERIENCE.

1651
01:08:20,830 --> 01:08:22,665
[MIKE SCATS]

1652
01:08:24,434 --> 01:08:26,703
[SERVO] SHE'S A SENIOR WITH<i> SASS!</i>

1653
01:08:27,870 --> 01:08:29,272
[CROW] BLING BLAGGA LOOBY DOFF!

1654
01:08:29,339 --> 01:08:30,873
DOOM-DIVEY-DOO FLINGY!

1655
01:08:30,940 --> 01:08:32,175
[MIKE LAUGHS]

1656
01:08:32,241 --> 01:08:34,143
BAB-BAB FAPOOB!

1657
01:08:37,880 --> 01:08:39,449
ZINGA-BLAGGA-BLOO.

1658
01:08:39,515 --> 01:08:41,017
<i>♪ CHOO CHOO ♪</i>

1659
01:08:41,217 --> 01:08:43,586
<i>♪ I AM WEAKER THAN A LITTLE CHILD ♪</i>

1660
01:08:43,786 --> 01:08:45,655
[SCATS]

1661
01:08:46,155 --> 01:08:48,925
[MIKE] GRANDMA ALWAYS GETS DRUNK
AND SINGS AT WEDDINGS.

1662
01:08:51,327 --> 01:08:53,696
[SERVO] ♪ CENTRUM SILVER
<i>IS WHAT YOU NEED ♪</i>

1663
01:08:53,763 --> 01:08:55,898
<i>♪ COME ON!</i>
<i>KABLINK BLAK BLOK ♪</i>

1664
01:08:57,033 --> 01:08:58,801
[CROW] CAN I GET A MEDIC OVER HERE?

1665
01:09:00,069 --> 01:09:02,038
[MIKE] MORE SCORBUTIC STRIPPERS.

1666
01:09:04,073 --> 01:09:06,309
[SERVO] OH, SHE'S SINGING
THE<i> THOMAS THE TANK ENGINE </i>THEME?

1667
01:09:07,877 --> 01:09:09,312
[CROW] BLINK BLOK BLOOP!

1668
01:09:09,379 --> 01:09:10,813
OH, LADY,
YOUR DRESS FELL OFF,

1669
01:09:10,880 --> 01:09:12,215
AND YOUR SOLID-GOLD
BRASSIERE

1670
01:09:12,281 --> 01:09:13,516
IS IRRITATING
THE WHOLE ROOM.

1671
01:09:13,583 --> 01:09:15,151
<i>♪ OOH WOW WOW ♪</i>

1672
01:09:15,218 --> 01:09:17,420
[MIKE SCATS]

1673
01:09:18,287 --> 01:09:20,590
[SERVO] WHY'D YOU CANCEL
<i>BATTLESTAR GALACTICA?</i>

1674
01:09:20,657 --> 01:09:23,092
JERRY, WHAT'RE YOU DOING HERE?

1675
01:09:23,159 --> 01:09:24,661
I'VE COME FOR A FEW ANSWERS.

1676
01:09:24,727 --> 01:09:26,863
[MIKE] IT'S RAINING, AND I CAME
TO STALK IN HERE.

1677
01:09:26,929 --> 01:09:28,131
I'M NOT SURE
WHAT HAPPENED LAST NIGHT

1678
01:09:28,197 --> 01:09:30,733
BEHIND THESE CURTAINS,
BUT I THINK YOU KNOW.

1679
01:09:43,046 --> 01:09:44,580
[SERVO] OH, ORTEGA,
MY GOOD MAN.

1680
01:09:44,647 --> 01:09:46,382
THESE RELLENOS WITH CRAB
AND SMOKEY GOUDA.

1681
01:09:46,449 --> 01:09:47,817
- FRESH CRAB?
- [ORTEGA GROWLS]

1682
01:09:47,884 --> 01:09:49,318
I THOUGHT SO-- DELICIOUS.

1683
01:09:49,385 --> 01:09:52,088
- OH HEY, MIKE.
- AAH! WHAT THE HELL IS THAT?

1684
01:09:52,155 --> 01:09:53,656
OH, I THINK THAT'S
THE SWEET POTATO HASH

1685
01:09:53,723 --> 01:09:55,591
WITH TOMATILLOS
AND SMOKED FLANK STEAK.

1686
01:09:55,658 --> 01:09:57,427
NOT THE FOOD,
I'M TALKING ABOUT HIM.

1687
01:09:57,493 --> 01:09:58,895
THAT IS ORTEGA.

1688
01:09:58,961 --> 01:10:01,330
I HIRED HIM TO CATER
THIS LITTLE MOVIE BREAK, MIKE.

1689
01:10:01,397 --> 01:10:04,467
THIS IS HIS FIRST JOB,
AND YOU'RE EMBARRASSING ME.

1690
01:10:04,534 --> 01:10:05,802
HOW DID YOU GET HIM UP HERE?

1691
01:10:05,868 --> 01:10:07,103
WELL, I CONTACTED
HIS WEBSITE,

1692
01:10:07,170 --> 01:10:08,438
AND HE SET EVERYTHING UP.

1693
01:10:08,504 --> 01:10:10,640
[SERVO] OH, MIKE, YOU GOTTA TRY
THESE BLUE CORN BASKETS

1694
01:10:10,707 --> 01:10:12,875
WITH FLAKED TROUT
AND CHIPOTLE VINAIGRETTE.

1695
01:10:12,942 --> 01:10:14,377
NAH, YOU KNOW,
I THINK I'LL PASS, SERVO.

1696
01:10:14,444 --> 01:10:15,978
I'M ABOUT TO GAG
FROM HIS BODY ODOR.

1697
01:10:16,045 --> 01:10:17,747
MIKE! GOOD HEAVENS, MAN.

1698
01:10:17,814 --> 01:10:19,515
ARE YOU TRYING
TO HUMILIATE ME?

1699
01:10:19,582 --> 01:10:21,451
JUST SMILE AND TAKE A PLATE.

1700
01:10:21,517 --> 01:10:23,052
I'M NOT GONNA TAKE A PLATE.

1701
01:10:23,119 --> 01:10:24,387
THE GUY HAS PROBABLY
GOT EAR MITES.

1702
01:10:24,454 --> 01:10:25,988
- GOD.
- WELL, STILL, THESE VENISON

1703
01:10:26,055 --> 01:10:28,091
AND GOAT CHEESE
TOSTADOS ARE HEAVENLY.

1704
01:10:28,157 --> 01:10:29,559
WHY WOULD YOU HIRE THIS GUY?

1705
01:10:29,625 --> 01:10:30,927
WELL, I GUESS
THAT'S JUST THE DIFFERENCE

1706
01:10:30,993 --> 01:10:32,462
BETWEEN ME AND YOU, MIKE.

1707
01:10:33,062 --> 01:10:35,331
THAT YOU HIRED
DEFORMED PSYCHOPATHS

1708
01:10:35,398 --> 01:10:36,966
- AND I DON'T?
- EXACTLY.

1709
01:10:37,033 --> 01:10:38,534
OH, OKAY-- OH, LOOK.

1710
01:10:38,601 --> 01:10:40,703
NOW HE'S ASHING
IN THE QUAIL EGGS. YOU SEE?

1711
01:10:40,770 --> 01:10:43,072
MIKE! HE HEARD THAT!

1712
01:10:43,139 --> 01:10:45,408
- [ORTEGA GROANING]
- ORTEGA-- ORTEGA, IT'S NOTHING!

1713
01:10:45,475 --> 01:10:47,310
WE'LL JUST EAT AROUND IT--

1714
01:10:47,376 --> 01:10:49,812
[ORTEGA SCREAMS]

1715
01:10:50,546 --> 01:10:51,948
GOOD ONE, MIKE.

1716
01:10:52,014 --> 01:10:53,282
YOU CAN JUST GET THE CATERER

1717
01:10:53,349 --> 01:10:55,752
FOR SERVO'S
FIRST COMMUNION YOURSELF.

1718
01:10:55,818 --> 01:10:57,153
YA BIG BULLY!

1719
01:10:57,220 --> 01:10:58,621
- [CROW SOBS]
- [SERVO] HUH?

1720
01:10:58,688 --> 01:11:00,256
WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK.

1721
01:11:00,323 --> 01:11:01,758
HE'S STILL SMOKING.

1722
01:11:05,995 --> 01:11:08,998
<i>- </i>[CROW] ♪ BLING BLAKKA DOOGIE ♪
- [MIKE] OKAY. ALL RIGHT. OKAY.

1723
01:11:09,065 --> 01:11:10,600
AFTER THIS AFTERNOON
WITH ANGELA,

1724
01:11:10,666 --> 01:11:11,801
I'M BEGINNING TO BELIEVE IT.

1725
01:11:12,635 --> 01:11:13,669
HAVE YOU BEEN DRINKING?

1726
01:11:13,736 --> 01:11:16,005
NO, NO, I HAVEN'T
BEEN DRINKING.

1727
01:11:16,072 --> 01:11:17,340
EVERYTHING'S BEEN
KIND OF MIXED UP.

1728
01:11:17,406 --> 01:11:19,609
BUT AFTER HEARING
THAT NEWS BROADCAST

1729
01:11:19,675 --> 01:11:21,811
- A LITTLE WHILE AGO--
- [CROWD CLAPS]

1730
01:11:21,878 --> 01:11:24,247
- THINGS ARE A LITTLE DIFFERENT.
- [MIKE] JUST DROP HIS MARBLES?

1731
01:11:24,313 --> 01:11:25,581
WHAT KIND OF THINGS?

1732
01:11:25,648 --> 01:11:27,283
LOOK, LAST NIGHT
I KILLED A GIRL,

1733
01:11:27,350 --> 01:11:28,518
AND I THINK YOU KNOW WHY.

1734
01:11:28,584 --> 01:11:29,786
[SERVO] OOPS, NO,
I DIDN'T MEAN THAT.

1735
01:11:29,852 --> 01:11:31,654
TELL ME--
WHAT HAPPENED LAST NIGHT

1736
01:11:31,721 --> 01:11:32,989
BEHIND THOSE CURTAINS?

1737
01:11:33,055 --> 01:11:34,357
BUT IF YOU REALLY MUST KNOW

1738
01:11:34,423 --> 01:11:35,525
WHAT HAPPENED
BEHIND THOSE CURTAINS,

1739
01:11:35,591 --> 01:11:37,426
WHY DON'T YOU
GO BEHIND THEM?

1740
01:11:37,493 --> 01:11:38,628
I THINK I WILL.

1741
01:11:39,762 --> 01:11:41,864
[MIKE] OH, THERE'S A MINING
FACILITY BACK THERE.

1742
01:11:41,931 --> 01:11:42,999
[SERVO] OF COURSE.

1743
01:11:44,267 --> 01:11:46,402
[CROW] OH, THE WASHING MACHINE'S
OUT OF BALANCE.

1744
01:11:47,770 --> 01:11:49,238
[SERVO] GOT MILK?

1745
01:11:50,273 --> 01:11:51,974
[SERVO] WE COULD GO
TO<i> DONNIE BRASCO.</i>

1746
01:11:55,978 --> 01:11:57,847
[SERVO] WELL, THAT
CLEARED UP NOTHING.

1747
01:11:59,415 --> 01:12:01,551
[CROW] CAN I BORROW A CUP
OF DIPPITY-DO?

1748
01:12:04,020 --> 01:12:05,388
[MIKE] WELCOME
TO PANELING WORLD.

1749
01:12:05,454 --> 01:12:07,223
WHAT KIND OF PANELING
CAN I SHOW YOU?

1750
01:12:07,290 --> 01:12:08,591
[SERVO] AND YET WE HEAR
THE DOOR SQUEAK

1751
01:12:08,658 --> 01:12:09,892
PERFECTLY WELL.

1752
01:12:09,959 --> 01:12:11,160
I GOT HERE
AS SOON AS I COULD.

1753
01:12:11,227 --> 01:12:13,029
I HAD TO RIDE THE BUS.
MY CAR WOULDN'T START.

1754
01:12:13,095 --> 01:12:15,765
HAROLD, WE'VE JUST GOT
TO FIND HIM AND HELP HIM.

1755
01:12:15,832 --> 01:12:17,333
I STILL THINK YOU
SHOULD CALL THE POLICE

1756
01:12:17,400 --> 01:12:19,001
INSTEAD OF TRYING
TO FIND HIM YOURSELF.

1757
01:12:19,101 --> 01:12:20,970
BUT HE'S MY ROOMMATE.
I KNOW THE GUY.

1758
01:12:21,070 --> 01:12:22,972
I KNOW HE'S NOT LIKE THAT.

1759
01:12:23,039 --> 01:12:24,207
[CROW] WELL, GEE, WALLY, I--

1760
01:12:25,842 --> 01:12:27,810
WOULD YOU PLEASE
GIVE US A CHANCE?

1761
01:12:27,877 --> 01:12:29,312
DON'T CALL THE POLICE, OKAY?

1762
01:12:29,378 --> 01:12:31,080
- [SERVO] PLEASE.
- YOU'RE RIGHT, MOTHER,

1763
01:12:31,147 --> 01:12:32,748
BUT LET'S WAIT
A LITTLE WHILE, SHALL WE?

1764
01:12:32,815 --> 01:12:34,717
HAROLD, ON THE PHONE
THIS AFTERNOON,

1765
01:12:34,784 --> 01:12:36,052
YOU TOLD ME
THAT HE WAS UPSET.

1766
01:12:36,118 --> 01:12:37,286
UPSET ABOUT WHAT?

1767
01:12:37,353 --> 01:12:38,855
[MIKE] I THINK... [MUMBLES]

1768
01:12:38,921 --> 01:12:40,957
I THOUGHT HE WAS UPSET
ABOUT LAST NIGHT.

1769
01:12:41,891 --> 01:12:44,560
I DIDN'T REALIZE HE WAS
ON THE VERGE OF GOING PSYCHO.

1770
01:12:44,627 --> 01:12:46,929
YOU KNOW, HE WAS ACTED AS IF
HE WAS GOING OUT OF HIS MIND.

1771
01:12:46,996 --> 01:12:49,365
[SERVO] PLEASE KNOW YOU CAN
TALK TO MY EARS ANYTIME.

1772
01:12:49,465 --> 01:12:51,868
IF HE'S IN A DAZE AND
WANDERING AROUND THE STREETS,

1773
01:12:51,934 --> 01:12:54,437
WE'VE GOT TO GET TO HIM
BEFORE THE POLICE PICK HIM UP.

1774
01:12:54,503 --> 01:12:56,005
DO YOU HAVE ANY IDEA
WHERE HE MIGHT'VE GONE?

1775
01:12:56,072 --> 01:12:58,007
[CROW] I WISH THAT GUY
WOULD STOP SCREAMING.

1776
01:12:59,609 --> 01:13:01,577
DO YOU SUPPOSE HE COULD'VE
GONE BACK TO THAT CARNIVAL

1777
01:13:01,644 --> 01:13:03,579
AND THAT GIRL CARMELITA
YOU TOLD ME ABOUT?

1778
01:13:03,646 --> 01:13:04,914
[SERVO] IT'S POINTY-VOICE THEATER.

1779
01:13:04,981 --> 01:13:06,849
THAT SOUNDS LIKE
SOMETHING HE'D DO.

1780
01:13:06,916 --> 01:13:09,385
SO WE'VE GOT TO GET TO HIM
BEFORE THE POLICE PICK HIM UP.

1781
01:13:09,552 --> 01:13:10,786
PLEASE GIVE US A CHANCE.

1782
01:13:11,187 --> 01:13:13,356
[MIKE] WE'LL TAKE YOUR ADVICE,
AND... [MUMBLES]

1783
01:13:14,423 --> 01:13:16,759
ALL RIGHT, ANGELA,
YOU CAN GO.

1784
01:13:16,826 --> 01:13:18,628
AS LONG AS MADISON
GOES WITH YOU.

1785
01:13:18,694 --> 01:13:20,463
BUT IF YOU'RE NOT BACK
IN THE NEXT TWO HOURS,

1786
01:13:20,529 --> 01:13:21,998
I'M GOING
TO CALL THE POLICE.

1787
01:13:22,465 --> 01:13:23,599
OKAY, THEN, LET'S GO!

1788
01:13:23,666 --> 01:13:25,735
[CROW] I JUST HAVE TO
SWING BY PRAGUE FIRST.

1789
01:13:26,469 --> 01:13:27,770
[SERVO] I PRE-WEDGIED MYSELF.

1790
01:13:29,605 --> 01:13:31,407
[MIKE] MADISON, DON'T FORGET
YOUR PUFFER.

1791
01:13:31,474 --> 01:13:33,075
AND YOUR KNEE BRACE!
AND YOUR EARPLUGS!

1792
01:13:33,142 --> 01:13:34,477
AND YOUR EYE DROPS!

1793
01:13:34,543 --> 01:13:36,178
[CARNIVAL MUSIC PLAYING]

1794
01:13:36,245 --> 01:13:38,281
[CROW] RIDE THE GIANT
CITRUS JUICER!

1795
01:13:39,315 --> 01:13:41,150
[MIKE HUMS ALONG]

1796
01:13:43,619 --> 01:13:45,922
[MIKE] THIS IS BEETHOVEN'S
WORST SYMPHONY.

1797
01:13:49,558 --> 01:13:51,427
- [STATUE LAUGHS]
- [SERVO] GET YOUR TERRIFYING

1798
01:13:51,494 --> 01:13:52,962
DEVIL MONKEYS.

1799
01:13:53,029 --> 01:13:54,764
[CROW] OH, IT'S ERNEST BORGNINE.

1800
01:13:57,500 --> 01:13:59,368
[LIGHT GENTLE JAZZ THEME PLAYING]

1801
01:13:59,435 --> 01:14:01,070
[SERVO]<i> ♪ I ♪</i>

1802
01:14:01,137 --> 01:14:03,005
<i>♪ SEND ME ♪</i>

1803
01:14:04,407 --> 01:14:05,841
<i>♪ I KNOW... ♪</i>

1804
01:14:05,908 --> 01:14:07,410
[MIKE] AUNT JEMIMA.
BECAUSE WE HAVE

1805
01:14:07,476 --> 01:14:10,012
SO MANY REASONS
TO CELEBRATE.

1806
01:14:10,313 --> 01:14:12,148
[CROW] CATWOMAN AT HOME.

1807
01:14:15,051 --> 01:14:17,119
[SERVO] IT'S HER ELABORATE
PREPARATION FOR<i> CAR TALK.</i>

1808
01:14:17,186 --> 01:14:18,254
♪♪♪ [SLOW JAZZ]

1809
01:14:18,321 --> 01:14:19,822
[MIKE] DOES ANYONE KNOW
WHO THIS IS?

1810
01:14:19,889 --> 01:14:21,057
[CROW] NO...

1811
01:14:23,059 --> 01:14:25,161
[CROW] SOUNDS LIKE SOMEONE'S
PLAYING A COW.

1812
01:14:27,096 --> 01:14:29,098
- [WOMAN GASPS]
- [SERVO] KNIFE DELIVERY!

1813
01:14:30,199 --> 01:14:32,268
[MIKE] CAN WE AT LEAST
HAVE A COCKTAIL FIRST?

1814
01:14:32,335 --> 01:14:33,903
[CROW] THE BUDGET ZOMBIE!

1815
01:14:33,970 --> 01:14:35,304
[WOMAN SCREAMS]

1816
01:14:37,206 --> 01:14:39,108
[DOORBELL BUZZES]

1817
01:14:39,175 --> 01:14:40,676
[SERVO] MIDDLE-AGED PEE WEE.

1818
01:14:40,876 --> 01:14:42,178
[CROW] IF THIS IS HER DATE,
THEN IT'LL BE

1819
01:14:42,244 --> 01:14:44,513
THE FIRST THING I UNDERSTAND
ABOUT THE WHOLE MOVIE.

1820
01:14:46,949 --> 01:14:49,018
[MIKE] AH, YOU HAVE TO TRY
HARDER THAN THAT

1821
01:14:49,085 --> 01:14:51,187
TO AVOID A DATE WITH ME.

1822
01:14:51,253 --> 01:14:52,521
[MAN] ESTELLA?

1823
01:14:52,588 --> 01:14:54,190
[SERVO] I BROUGHT
CHEDDAR COMBOS.

1824
01:14:56,826 --> 01:14:57,994
[CROW CHUCKLES]

1825
01:14:58,461 --> 01:15:00,129
[CROW] HEY, A CARNIVAL.

1826
01:15:00,196 --> 01:15:01,063
[MIKE] WOW.

1827
01:15:04,166 --> 01:15:05,468
[MIKE] THAT'S IT.
I'M GONNA TRY ON

1828
01:15:05,534 --> 01:15:07,536
MORE NAVY HOODED
SWEATSHIRTS.

1829
01:15:09,005 --> 01:15:11,240
[SERVO] YEAH, LOOK, SEE HOW
MY SKIN JUST PEELS OFF?

1830
01:15:13,442 --> 01:15:15,344
<i>[CROW HUMMING TONIGHT SHOW THEME]</i>

1831
01:15:17,480 --> 01:15:18,781
[MIKE WITH RASPY VOICE]
WATCH A TAPEWORM

1832
01:15:18,848 --> 01:15:21,083
JUST GOES BACK
INTO MY HAND. SEE THAT?

1833
01:15:23,119 --> 01:15:24,987
[SERVO] I DO LOVE ORTEGA,
AND YOU CANNOT STOP US.

1834
01:15:25,054 --> 01:15:27,790
WELCOME, ORTEGA.

1835
01:15:27,857 --> 01:15:31,460
- YOU HAVE DONE SO VERY WELL.
- [SERVO] YES.

1836
01:15:31,527 --> 01:15:34,663
THIS TIME, I THINK THAT YOU OUGHT
TO GET YOUR AWARD.

1837
01:15:34,730 --> 01:15:35,998
- ORTEGA--
- [CROW] YEAH, WHAT?

1838
01:15:36,065 --> 01:15:37,900
- BRING ME THE ACID.
- [CROW] OKAY, SURE.

1839
01:15:37,967 --> 01:15:40,703
IT IS TOO BAD THAT
YOU REMEMBERED SO MUCH.

1840
01:15:40,770 --> 01:15:42,138
[MIKE] I LIKE ORTEGA'S LOOK.

1841
01:15:42,204 --> 01:15:45,408
NOW YOU HAVE LEFT ME
VERY LITTLE CHOICE.

1842
01:15:47,209 --> 01:15:49,612
[SERVO] UH, MA'AM, THAT WAS A SPRITE
I HAD SITTING OVER THERE.

1843
01:15:49,678 --> 01:15:51,180
TAKE HIM BACK
AND PUT HIM WITH

1844
01:15:51,247 --> 01:15:52,515
THE REST OF THE LITTLE PETS.

1845
01:15:52,581 --> 01:15:53,749
[CROW] PUT HIM IN THE NICE ROOM

1846
01:15:53,816 --> 01:15:56,118
WITH ALL THE OTHER
FILTHY PIGS.

1847
01:15:57,253 --> 01:15:59,255
[MIKE] I NOTICE YOU HAVEN'T
SOILED YOURSELF YET, SIR.

1848
01:15:59,321 --> 01:16:00,589
IS THERE A PROBLEM?

1849
01:16:00,656 --> 01:16:02,591
[SERVO] ZOMBIE WALKIN'!

1850
01:16:03,492 --> 01:16:05,828
[CROW] SO YOU'RE THE JERRY
I'VE BEEN HEARING ABOUT.

1851
01:16:05,895 --> 01:16:07,396
POOL'S ON
THE EIGHTH FLOOR, JERRY.

1852
01:16:07,463 --> 01:16:09,065
WHERE'RE YOU FROM, JERRY?

1853
01:16:14,403 --> 01:16:15,671
[MIKE] YEAH, JUST BEND DOWN.

1854
01:16:15,738 --> 01:16:17,339
USUALLY THE ZOMBIES
ARE A LITTLE SHORTER.

1855
01:16:17,406 --> 01:16:18,607
I'M SORRY ABOUT THAT.

1856
01:16:19,542 --> 01:16:20,943
[SERVO] NEIL YOUNG IS ATTACKING!

1857
01:16:21,010 --> 01:16:23,345
GET BACK... YOU GET BACK! AARGH!

1858
01:16:23,546 --> 01:16:25,214
[CROW] WOW, THEY HAD
AN INTRICATE ESCAPE PLAN.

1859
01:16:25,281 --> 01:16:27,416
WHEN SHE OPENS THE DOOR,
JUMP ON HER!

1860
01:16:27,483 --> 01:16:28,751
[MIKE] THESE ARE JUST THE CARNIES.

1861
01:16:28,818 --> 01:16:30,486
WAIT'LL THE ZOMBIES
COME OUT.

1862
01:16:34,223 --> 01:16:35,357
[SERVO] BOY, YOU KNOW,
YOU GIVE YOUR KID

1863
01:16:35,424 --> 01:16:36,725
A CUTE LITTLE ZOMBIE
FOR EASTER,

1864
01:16:36,792 --> 01:16:38,527
AND THEN IT GROWS UP
LIKE THIS.

1865
01:16:39,161 --> 01:16:40,529
[CROW] OUTSIDE WITH THIS, MEN.

1866
01:16:40,596 --> 01:16:42,364
OUTSIDE, YOUNG PEOPLE.

1867
01:16:43,399 --> 01:16:45,134
[MIKE] NO! NOT ORTEGA!

1868
01:16:45,201 --> 01:16:46,769
[MIKE SOBS] ORTEGA!

1869
01:16:46,836 --> 01:16:48,070
[SERVO] VANCE!

1870
01:16:50,773 --> 01:16:52,341
[CROW] AHH, CROSS-DRESSING BRITISH

1871
01:16:52,408 --> 01:16:54,009
POLICE INSPECTOR STRIPPER ARRIVES.

1872
01:16:54,076 --> 01:16:55,311
[MIKE AND SERVO LAUGH]

1873
01:16:57,813 --> 01:16:59,949
[MIKE] WELL, I'D LIKE TO ATTACK,
BUT MY NAILS AREN'T DRY!

1874
01:17:02,885 --> 01:17:04,019
ESTRELLA?

1875
01:17:04,587 --> 01:17:05,621
ESTRELLA?

1876
01:17:07,323 --> 01:17:09,892
[CROW] I HATE THE WAY THEY
STEREOTYPE ZOMBIES IN THIS MOVIE.

1877
01:17:09,959 --> 01:17:11,360
[SERVO] HEY, IT'S CLINT HOWARD.

1878
01:17:12,895 --> 01:17:14,463
[PEOPLE SCREAMING]

1879
01:17:14,530 --> 01:17:15,698
[MIKE] HEY, A CARNIVAL.

1880
01:17:15,764 --> 01:17:16,966
[CROW] YEAH, WOW.

1881
01:17:20,603 --> 01:17:22,204
[CROW] I'M ALMOST DONE OVER HERE.

1882
01:17:26,275 --> 01:17:27,610
[SERVO] HEY, BIG-HEAD TODD.

1883
01:17:28,010 --> 01:17:29,578
AND THE MONSTER!

1884
01:17:31,480 --> 01:17:34,316
[MIKE] JEEZ, YOU COMB YOUR HAIR
WITH AN EGG-BEATER, TED?

1885
01:17:35,384 --> 01:17:37,620
[SERVO] HEY GUYS, LET'S RUN AROUND
OUTSIDE IN OUR JAMMIES.

1886
01:17:37,686 --> 01:17:38,654
WHOO!

1887
01:17:43,993 --> 01:17:46,495
[CROW] MM, THAT TICK ON HER FACE
IS PANICKING NOW.

1888
01:17:46,562 --> 01:17:48,063
[SERVO] I NEED BLOOD, WAKE UP!

1889
01:17:48,130 --> 01:17:49,832
PLEASE WAKE UP!

1890
01:17:50,533 --> 01:17:52,434
[MIKE] WELL, SHE AND ORTEGA
ARE IN A BETTER PLACE.

1891
01:17:52,501 --> 01:17:55,171
THEY'RE LIVING UNDER THAT
DAMP, STINKY COUCH IN THE SKY.

1892
01:17:59,975 --> 01:18:02,278
[CROW] HI, EVERYBODY,
I'M DENNIS JAMES.

1893
01:18:04,113 --> 01:18:05,814
[MIKE]<i> THE CLONES OF FUNKENSTEIN!</i>

1894
01:18:05,881 --> 01:18:08,083
[CROW] PSYCHOFUNKAPUS!

1895
01:18:11,787 --> 01:18:13,889
[SERVO] ♪ I'M GONNA
<i>TELL YOU ALL A STORY ♪</i>

1896
01:18:13,956 --> 01:18:15,624
<i>♪ 'BOUT A HARPER VALLEY ♪</i>

1897
01:18:15,691 --> 01:18:18,327
<i>♪ WIDOW WIFE ♪</i>

1898
01:18:18,394 --> 01:18:20,696
[MIKE] IT'S THE KID
'N PLAY DANCERS.

1899
01:18:20,763 --> 01:18:21,964
[SERVO] WOW.

1900
01:18:22,031 --> 01:18:24,433
[CROW] OH, THEY TURNED LEECH
WOMAN INTO A MUSICAL.

1901
01:18:25,701 --> 01:18:28,737
[SERVO] A COMMAND PERFORMANCE
FOR JESSE HELMS.

1902
01:18:30,072 --> 01:18:31,340
[SERVO] UH, COME IN
THROUGH THE KITCHEN.

1903
01:18:31,407 --> 01:18:32,641
THEY KNOW ME HERE.

1904
01:18:33,676 --> 01:18:36,145
[CROW] LAWRENCE WELK REACHES OUT
TO THE BLACK AUDIENCE.

1905
01:18:36,212 --> 01:18:37,713
[SERVO CHUCKLES]

1906
01:18:37,780 --> 01:18:39,281
[MIKE] SO THEY'RE WHITE PEOPLE

1907
01:18:39,348 --> 01:18:41,717
DRESSED AS AFRICANS
IN WHITEFACE.

1908
01:18:41,784 --> 01:18:43,052
[SERVO] CONFUSING.

1909
01:18:46,755 --> 01:18:48,524
[SERVO]<i> ♪ BURIED WITH MY DONKEY ♪</i>

1910
01:18:48,591 --> 01:18:51,193
<i>♪ HE'S MY FAVORITE HONKY ♪</i>

1911
01:18:51,260 --> 01:18:52,728
[CROW] THEY'RE AFRICAN
LADIES IN WAITING

1912
01:18:52,795 --> 01:18:54,063
WHO ARE INUIT AND SWEDISH

1913
01:18:54,129 --> 01:18:55,864
- AND DRESSED IN TIGHTS.
- [SERVO] UH-HUH.

1914
01:18:55,931 --> 01:18:58,434
[MIKE] THE INDIGO GIRLS
TRY TO FIND THE STAGE.

1915
01:19:02,705 --> 01:19:04,306
[SERVO] ALL THIS PAGEANTRY
CAN'T HIDE THE FACT

1916
01:19:04,373 --> 01:19:05,841
THAT THERE'S NO STRIPPING.

1917
01:19:07,243 --> 01:19:09,578
[CROW] SEEMS LIKE STRIPPING WOULD
BE A LOT CHEAPER TO PRODUCE.

1918
01:19:14,416 --> 01:19:16,852
[MIKE] IS THIS CONFUSE-A-CAT?

1919
01:19:17,386 --> 01:19:19,121
[SERVO] HEY, HE'S JUST
IN HIS UNDERPANTS.

1920
01:19:19,188 --> 01:19:20,889
- PUT ON SOME PANTS.
- [MIKE] OH...

1921
01:19:20,956 --> 01:19:22,725
[CROW] SORRY, I THOUGHT
IT WOULD BE FUNNY.

1922
01:19:22,791 --> 01:19:24,627
NOW I'M JUST ASHAMED.
I'LL-- I'LL GO.

1923
01:19:29,031 --> 01:19:30,399
[MIKE] HOW BANAL.

1924
01:19:30,466 --> 01:19:32,134
[SERVO] THE ZOMBIES JUST WANT
MORE STAGE TIME.

1925
01:19:32,201 --> 01:19:35,404
[CROWD SCREAMS]

1926
01:19:35,604 --> 01:19:36,839
[CROW] I HAVE FEAR.

1927
01:19:40,976 --> 01:19:42,845
[MIKE] THE BEACH BOYS
WAITING OUTSIDE.

1928
01:19:43,512 --> 01:19:44,480
[SERVO] DONE AND DONE.

1929
01:19:47,383 --> 01:19:49,084
[CROW] HEY, THAT BARKER'S
SUPPOSED TO BE DEAD.

1930
01:19:49,151 --> 01:19:50,219
WHAT THE...

1931
01:19:52,688 --> 01:19:54,523
[MIKE] WELL, NOW WHERE ARE
THEY GONNA GO IN TOWN

1932
01:19:54,590 --> 01:19:57,092
FOR GAY DANCING AND RACIST
PRODUCTION NUMBERS?

1933
01:19:57,159 --> 01:19:58,694
[CROW] OFFICER BOITANO.

1934
01:20:01,530 --> 01:20:03,198
[SERVO IN SNOBBY VOICE]
OH NO, COPS.

1935
01:20:04,600 --> 01:20:06,402
[MIKE] I'M GOING, I'M GOING
BACK TO MY CAGE.

1936
01:20:06,468 --> 01:20:07,536
EVERYTHING'S COOL.

1937
01:20:09,738 --> 01:20:10,873
[CROW] NICE PLANT.

1938
01:20:12,441 --> 01:20:14,410
[MIKE] POOR KIDS.
THEY'RE JUST MIXED UP.

1939
01:20:15,244 --> 01:20:16,545
[ZOMBIE SCREAMS]

1940
01:20:16,612 --> 01:20:17,479
[SERVO] FASCIST.

1941
01:20:19,548 --> 01:20:22,551
[CROW] OH, WATCH THIS. HE'S ONLY
50 YEARS FROM RETIREMENT TOO.

1942
01:20:23,485 --> 01:20:24,953
[MIKE] HE'S A COP GONE BAD.

1943
01:20:25,020 --> 01:20:27,656
[SERVO] I MEAN, HE'S JUST A COP
THAT'S REALLY BAD AT HIS JOB.

1944
01:20:29,958 --> 01:20:32,294
[MIKE] UM, I GUESS YOU GOT IT
UNDER CONTROL.

1945
01:20:35,230 --> 01:20:36,565
[CROW] YOU KNOW,
I'M SICK OF THIS, BOB.

1946
01:20:36,632 --> 01:20:38,901
THIS IS THE THIRD ZOMBIE
I'VE PULLED OFF YOU THIS WEEK.

1947
01:20:45,107 --> 01:20:46,608
[MIKE] OH, WHY, JUST YESTERDAY

1948
01:20:46,675 --> 01:20:48,844
I WAS SLIPPING DOLLARS
INTO HER BIKINI.

1949
01:20:49,678 --> 01:20:51,880
- COME ON, LET'S GET THROUGH!
- HEY! HEY, HEY!

1950
01:20:53,782 --> 01:20:56,618
[CROW] UH, SORRY FOLKS,
THE WOMEN'S EXPO IS CANCELLED.

1951
01:20:56,685 --> 01:20:58,821
[SERVO] HURRY UP, MAYBE
WE GET SOMETHING TO EAT.

1952
01:20:59,621 --> 01:21:00,622
[DOG BARKS]

1953
01:21:00,689 --> 01:21:03,058
[MIKE] WHAT IS WITH
THE PERIODIC DOG BARK?

1954
01:21:03,125 --> 01:21:04,426
[CROW] WOOF!

1955
01:21:07,129 --> 01:21:09,765
[SERVO] AH, INSPECTOR MADISON.
THANK GOD YOU'RE HERE.

1956
01:21:09,832 --> 01:21:12,034
[ZOMBIE GROWLS]

1957
01:21:12,101 --> 01:21:13,469
[CROW] JACKIE MASON!

1958
01:21:13,535 --> 01:21:15,270
[SERVO] I HAVE
CORN BLIGHT-- PLEASE!

1959
01:21:16,238 --> 01:21:17,539
[ZOMBIE GRUNTS]

1960
01:21:17,606 --> 01:21:19,675
-[SCREAMS]
-[SERVO] I BIT MY KNUCKLE!

1961
01:21:23,379 --> 01:21:25,013
[CROW] UGH, NO NO, I'M UP.

1962
01:21:25,080 --> 01:21:26,915
I'M UP, I JUST
NEED SOME COFFEE.

1963
01:21:30,185 --> 01:21:31,720
[SERVO] OH, SLEPT WITH MY CONTACTS.

1964
01:21:31,787 --> 01:21:33,322
- [SERVO] OW.
- JERRY!

1965
01:21:33,555 --> 01:21:35,791
- [ANGIE SCREAMS]
- [SERVO] DON'T WALK ON THE COUCH!

1966
01:21:39,161 --> 01:21:41,196
[CROW] STOP! COME ON, YOU BOOGER!

1967
01:21:43,298 --> 01:21:45,701
[SERVO] I STILL HAVE SOME RIDES
LEFT ON MY TICKET.

1968
01:21:47,403 --> 01:21:48,670
[SERVO] SHE RUNS LIKE A GIRL.

1969
01:21:48,737 --> 01:21:51,006
[ANGIE] COME BACK, PLEASE!
COME BACK!

1970
01:21:52,307 --> 01:21:54,777
[CROW] JERRY LEWIS IS
STEVE PREFONTAINE.

1971
01:21:56,912 --> 01:21:58,881
[SERVO PANTS]

1972
01:22:02,251 --> 01:22:04,486
[SERVO AS JERRY LEWIS]
<i>♪ I VOWED I-- ♪ WHOA!</i>

1973
01:22:04,553 --> 01:22:06,388
<i>♪ FROM HERE TO ETERNITY ♪</i>

1974
01:22:06,455 --> 01:22:07,790
<i>♪ A LADY, OH ♪</i>

1975
01:22:07,856 --> 01:22:09,992
[ANGIE] WAIT, JERRY, DON'T!

1976
01:22:11,093 --> 01:22:13,529
[CROW] I WISH I WERE
LIQUID METAL, MAN.

1977
01:22:14,630 --> 01:22:16,398
[MIKE AS JERRY LEWIS]
WOW, DEAN, I--

1978
01:22:16,465 --> 01:22:18,567
WHOA, SORRY, ON THE BEACH.

1979
01:22:18,634 --> 01:22:20,803
WHOA...

1980
01:22:22,438 --> 01:22:24,173
[SERVO HUMS "YAKETY SAX"]

1981
01:22:26,742 --> 01:22:28,477
[CROW] MADISON,
THE BOY WHO SHOULD BE

1982
01:22:28,544 --> 01:22:29,812
IN A PLASTIC BUBBLE.

1983
01:22:31,713 --> 01:22:33,449
[SERVO] I FEEL SO FREE.

1984
01:22:34,950 --> 01:22:36,485
[SERVO AS JERRY LEWIS] WOW!
YOU DID IT, YOU FINALLY DID IT!

1985
01:22:36,552 --> 01:22:37,820
DAMN YOU ALL TO HELL!

1986
01:22:37,886 --> 01:22:40,556
[MIKE] ANY CHANCE A PELICAN WILL
DROP A TURTLE ON HIS HEAD?

1987
01:22:40,989 --> 01:22:41,990
[ANGIE] DON'T!

1988
01:22:45,661 --> 01:22:47,329
[MIKE] RIGHT ABOUT NOW,
THE CRABS ARE OUT THERE

1989
01:22:47,396 --> 01:22:49,231
SETTING A TABLE,
LAYING OUT THE CONDIMENTS.

1990
01:22:49,298 --> 01:22:50,365
[SERVO] YEP.

1991
01:22:51,099 --> 01:22:52,601
JERRY, PLEASE!

1992
01:22:53,635 --> 01:22:55,737
[SERVO] SAIL AWAY!

1993
01:22:57,806 --> 01:22:59,408
WHAT'S THE MATTER WITH YOU?

1994
01:22:59,475 --> 01:23:01,109
[MIKE]<i> ♪ JERRY THE ZOMBIE ♪</i>

1995
01:23:01,176 --> 01:23:02,511
<i>♪ ON THE ROCKS ♪</i>

1996
01:23:02,578 --> 01:23:04,446
<i>♪ SAY YES ♪</i>

1997
01:23:05,747 --> 01:23:07,182
[CROW] CROAT AND MADISON.

1998
01:23:07,249 --> 01:23:08,350
THEY'RE FEEBS.

1999
01:23:11,620 --> 01:23:13,388
- [SERVO MUMBLES]
- [MIKE] MADISON!

2000
01:23:15,157 --> 01:23:16,391
[CROW] YOU KNOW,
THERE ARE EASIER WAYS

2001
01:23:16,458 --> 01:23:18,327
TO CLEAN YOUR SKIN
WITH PUMICE.

2002
01:23:21,430 --> 01:23:23,532
[SERVO] I LOST A CONTACT
OUT HERE SOMEWHERE.

2003
01:23:25,667 --> 01:23:27,202
[MIKE] IF HE WASN'T CONFUSED
BY THE BEACH,

2004
01:23:27,269 --> 01:23:28,570
HE WOULDN'T BE JERRY.

2005
01:23:31,073 --> 01:23:32,541
[CROW] STOP, OR I'LL SHOOT.

2006
01:23:34,176 --> 01:23:36,178
[SERVO] WELL, SOME MOVIES INSPIRE
YOU TO MAKE YOUR OWN MOVIE.

2007
01:23:36,245 --> 01:23:38,380
THIS ONE INSPIRES ME
TO MAKE MY OWN GRAVY.

2008
01:23:38,447 --> 01:23:39,448
[MIKE LAUGHS]

2009
01:23:44,186 --> 01:23:46,922
[MIKE] WHEN A KENNEDY TOUCH
FOOTBALL GAME GETS OUT OF HAND.

2010
01:23:49,391 --> 01:23:50,792
[SERVO] WELL, IF HE DOESN'T
FEEL FRESH BY NOW,

2011
01:23:50,859 --> 01:23:51,860
IT'S NEVER GONNA HAPPEN.

2012
01:23:51,927 --> 01:23:52,895
[MIKE] NUH-UH.

2013
01:23:57,666 --> 01:23:59,234
[CROW] I LOVE YOU, JERRY!

2014
01:23:59,301 --> 01:24:01,036
YOU HAVE SO MUCH
TO LIVE FOR!

2015
01:24:02,938 --> 01:24:05,040
[MIKE] HMM, MADISON HAD
AN ADENOID ATTACK

2016
01:24:05,107 --> 01:24:06,308
AND HAD TO HOLD BACK.

2017
01:24:07,643 --> 01:24:09,344
[SERVO] LACK OF MUSCLE BEACH.

2018
01:24:11,380 --> 01:24:13,415
[CROW MIMICS CAR ENGINE]

2019
01:24:18,253 --> 01:24:19,588
[SERVO] I GOT YOU. BA-DOW! BA-DOW!

2020
01:24:19,655 --> 01:24:20,522
PEW-PEW!

2021
01:24:21,056 --> 01:24:23,725
[SERVO] MADISON'S OFF SOMEWHERE,
SEWING NAMETAGS IN HIS UNDERWEAR.

2022
01:24:24,793 --> 01:24:28,730
[CROW MUMBLES]
JERRY-JERRY-JERRY!

2023
01:24:29,665 --> 01:24:31,833
[MIKE] ARE YOU TRYING TO RUN
AROUND THE ENGLISH CHANNEL?

2024
01:24:32,467 --> 01:24:34,736
[SERVO] SEEING AS HOW
THIS IS A .44 MAGNUM...

2025
01:24:36,905 --> 01:24:38,407
{\an8}NO, NO!

2026
01:24:38,740 --> 01:24:40,409
{\an8}[ANGIE] NO, JERRY, PLEASE!

2027
01:24:40,475 --> 01:24:41,810
{\an8}[CROW] YES, JERRY, YES.

2028
01:24:41,877 --> 01:24:43,245
{\an8}- [CROW] DO IT.
- [MIKE] DO IT.

2029
01:24:45,180 --> 01:24:46,448
[MIKE] MADISON IS STILL BACK THERE

2030
01:24:46,515 --> 01:24:47,916
TRYING TO PUT ON HIS TOTES.

2031
01:24:49,484 --> 01:24:50,886
JERRY!

2032
01:24:53,655 --> 01:24:55,324
[SERVO] YOU CAN FOLLOW MY HAIR!

2033
01:24:55,691 --> 01:24:57,526
- [CROW] MADISON!
- GO BACK!

2034
01:24:57,926 --> 01:24:59,928
[MIKE] GO HOME! GO HOME!

2035
01:24:59,995 --> 01:25:01,763
[JERRY] GO BACK!

2036
01:25:02,564 --> 01:25:03,832
GO BACK!

2037
01:25:04,166 --> 01:25:05,300
STAY AWAY!

2038
01:25:06,368 --> 01:25:08,270
[SERVO] WELL, MAYBE
HE'S ACTUALLY A SILKY.

2039
01:25:08,337 --> 01:25:10,105
[CROW] NO, I THINK
HE'S A MUCUSY.

2040
01:25:10,172 --> 01:25:11,673
[MIKE LAUGHS]

2041
01:25:13,609 --> 01:25:14,977
GO BACK!

2042
01:25:15,377 --> 01:25:16,578
[SERVO] MY HAIR WANTS
TO TALK TO YOU!

2043
01:25:17,646 --> 01:25:18,981
GO BACK!

2044
01:25:20,048 --> 01:25:22,217
[SERVO] OR SHOOT,
WHICHEVER WORKS OUT BEST.

2045
01:25:22,284 --> 01:25:23,485
NO!

2046
01:25:25,420 --> 01:25:27,723
[MIKE] HEY, GRAB THE CAMERA AND GET
SOME SHOTS ON THE WAY DOWN!

2047
01:25:30,993 --> 01:25:32,728
- [ANGIE SCREAMS]
- [MIKE] MADISON'S SISTER.

2048
01:25:33,695 --> 01:25:35,564
[CROW] YOU KNOW, I DON'T KNOW
IF I EVER TOLD YOU THIS, MIKE,

2049
01:25:35,631 --> 01:25:38,600
BUT MY LIFE, MY LOVE,
AND MY LADY IS THE SEA.

2050
01:25:38,767 --> 01:25:39,935
[MIKE] UH, YEAH, YOU DID, ACTUALLY.

2051
01:25:40,002 --> 01:25:41,803
- YOU MENTIONED IT ONE TIME.
- [CROW] OH, I DID, SORRY.

2052
01:25:45,607 --> 01:25:47,342
[MIKE] CRACKLE MOURNS
THE DEATH OF POP.

2053
01:25:48,343 --> 01:25:50,379
[CROW] NOW, NOW BRANDY.
SHE WAS A FINE GIRL.

2054
01:25:50,445 --> 01:25:51,747
WHAT A GOOD WIFE
SHE WOULD BE.

2055
01:25:51,813 --> 01:25:53,782
BUT, AS I PREVIOUSLY STATED,

2056
01:25:53,849 --> 01:25:55,484
MY LIFE, MY LOVE,
AND MY LADY

2057
01:25:55,550 --> 01:25:57,619
- [MIKE] IS-- IS THE--
- [CROW] IS THE SEA.

2058
01:25:57,686 --> 01:25:59,821
[CROW] YEAH, THE SEA.

2059
01:26:00,689 --> 01:26:02,024
[SERVO] MARINA OSWALD LOOKS ON.

2060
01:26:05,794 --> 01:26:07,029
JERRY!

2061
01:26:11,133 --> 01:26:12,467
[CROW] WELL, I'M GOING TO LAS VEGAS

2062
01:26:12,534 --> 01:26:14,069
TO DRINK MYSELF TO DEATH.

2063
01:26:16,905 --> 01:26:17,939
[SERVO] SURGE!

2064
01:26:18,006 --> 01:26:19,007
[MIKE LAUGHS]

2065
01:26:20,642 --> 01:26:21,510
[MIKE] MADISON!

2066
01:26:22,310 --> 01:26:24,746
[CROW] HERE, OFFICER, YOU CAN
SHOOT HIM BETTER FROM HERE.

2067
01:26:26,515 --> 01:26:27,516
[SERVO] MADISON!

2068
01:26:29,017 --> 01:26:31,453
[MIKE] THAT COP'S REPORT
HAS TO BE SIGNED BY HIS MOM.

2069
01:26:31,520 --> 01:26:32,621
[SERVO CHUCKLES]

2070
01:26:38,827 --> 01:26:41,063
[SERVO] LOOK, YOU HAVE A CRANE SHOT
JUST FOR HER HAIR.

2071
01:26:42,097 --> 01:26:43,665
[CROW] I'LL SUCK THE BULLET OUT.

2072
01:26:48,537 --> 01:26:49,471
[MIKE] MADISON!

2073
01:26:50,272 --> 01:26:51,840
[SERVO MUMBLES]

2074
01:26:55,077 --> 01:26:56,511
[CROW] WE HOPE YOU'VE ENJOYED

2075
01:26:56,578 --> 01:26:58,580
"NO MORAL THEATER,"
LADIES AND GENTLEMEN.

2076
01:26:58,647 --> 01:27:01,116
[MIKE] THE CAMERA PULLS BACK
AS IF TO SAY,

2077
01:27:01,249 --> 01:27:02,384
"SORRY ABOUT THIS, EVERYONE.

2078
01:27:02,451 --> 01:27:03,685
IT'S MY FAULT, SORRY."

2079
01:27:04,419 --> 01:27:06,722
[SERVO] OH, I THOUGHT IT WAS
HOLLYWOOD, REPUBLIC OF CHAD.

2080
01:27:06,788 --> 01:27:07,656
[CROW] YEAH.

2081
01:27:09,291 --> 01:27:11,893
[MIKE AND SERVO]<i> ♪ OOH-OOH ♪</i>

2082
01:27:11,960 --> 01:27:14,096
[CROW]<i> ♪ BABY BABY ♪</i>

2083
01:27:17,666 --> 01:27:20,001
[MIKE] MADISON<i> IS </i>MADISON.

2084
01:27:20,068 --> 01:27:21,670
[CROW] DRUNK PLAYED BY HIMSELF.

2085
01:27:21,737 --> 01:27:24,172
HOBO, HIMSELF.
STRIPPER, HERSELF.

2086
01:27:26,742 --> 01:27:29,811
[SERVO] ♪ THE INCREDIBLY
<i>STRANGE CREATURES ♪</i>

2087
01:27:29,878 --> 01:27:33,381
<i>♪ WHO STOPPED LIVING</i>
<i>AND BECAME ♪</i>

2088
01:27:33,448 --> 01:27:37,052
<i>♪ MIXED-UP ZOMBIES ♪</i>

2089
01:27:37,719 --> 01:27:39,855
<i>♪ THE INCREDIBLY</i>
<i>STRANGE CREATURES ♪</i>

2090
01:27:39,921 --> 01:27:41,723
<i>♪ WHO STOPPED LIVING</i>
<i>AND BECAME ♪</i>

2091
01:27:41,790 --> 01:27:44,493
<i>♪ MIXED-UP ZOMBIES ♪</i>

2092
01:27:44,559 --> 01:27:46,361
<i>♪ THE INCREDIBLY</i>
<i>STRANGE CREATURES... ♪</i>

2093
01:27:58,840 --> 01:28:00,208
[SERVO] WHOO-HOO-HOO.

2094
01:28:00,275 --> 01:28:01,910
SO THIS IS
A ROLLER-COASTER, THEN?

2095
01:28:01,977 --> 01:28:03,712
- WELL, SURE IT IS.
- IN A MANNER OF SPEAKING.

2096
01:28:03,779 --> 01:28:05,147
- ABSOLUTELY.
- OKAY.

2097
01:28:05,213 --> 01:28:06,815
'CAUSE IT SEEMS TO BE
MISSING SOME OF THE THINGS

2098
01:28:06,882 --> 01:28:08,150
THAT THE ROLLER-COASTER
IN THE MOVIE HAD.

2099
01:28:08,216 --> 01:28:09,718
LIKE, UH, A TRACK.

2100
01:28:09,785 --> 01:28:11,620
REALLY? HUH.
INTERESTING CHOICE.

2101
01:28:11,686 --> 01:28:13,989
YOU KNOW, I THINK
THE SCREAMING LEMUR

2102
01:28:14,055 --> 01:28:15,457
OFFERS YOU
A MORE SOPHISTICATED

2103
01:28:15,524 --> 01:28:17,325
ILLUSION OF DANGER, MIKE.

2104
01:28:17,392 --> 01:28:18,960
OKAY, IS THERE A SAFETY BAR?

2105
01:28:19,027 --> 01:28:20,562
OH, I GOT YOU COVERED THERE.
JUST GRAB THAT

2106
01:28:20,629 --> 01:28:23,265
ROLL OF DUCT TAPE DOWN THERE
AND STRAP YOURSELF IN SECURELY.

2107
01:28:23,331 --> 01:28:25,600
HEH-HEH. UH, PLEASE KEEP
YOUR ARMS INSIDE

2108
01:28:25,667 --> 01:28:27,669
AND DO NOT STAND UP
ON THIS RIDE.

2109
01:28:27,736 --> 01:28:29,504
AND DON'T FORGET
YOUR COMPLIMENTARY

2110
01:28:29,571 --> 01:28:31,807
CUP OF STEAMING-HOT
COLOMBIAN COFFEE.

2111
01:28:31,873 --> 01:28:33,542
OH, OKAY, OOH!
THIS SMELLS GOOD.

2112
01:28:33,608 --> 01:28:35,143
- HERE WE GO.
- OKAY, HERE WE GO, MIKE.

2113
01:28:35,210 --> 01:28:36,511
OH, CAN I GET
A LID FOR THIS--

2114
01:28:36,578 --> 01:28:38,480
- [MIKE SCREAMS]
- [BOTS] SCREAMING LEMUR!

2115
01:28:38,547 --> 01:28:40,582
- [METAL CRASHES]
- OW! OH! OH!

2116
01:28:40,649 --> 01:28:43,418
- [MIKE] OOH, MY RIBS!
- WOW.

2117
01:28:43,485 --> 01:28:46,421
HUH, MAYBE WE SHOULD
LOOK INTO THAT TRACK THING.

2118
01:28:46,488 --> 01:28:49,224
YEAH. HEY, LET'S SEE
WHAT PEARL'S DOING, HUH?

2119
01:28:49,925 --> 01:28:51,493
NO TIME TO TALK, ART.

2120
01:28:52,160 --> 01:28:53,428
ARE WE AT DAIRY QUEEN YET?

2121
01:28:53,495 --> 01:28:54,763
NO, NO, HONEY, WE'RE HOME.

2122
01:28:54,830 --> 01:28:57,666
COME ON, KIDS, CHOP-CHOP.
YOUR PARENTS ARE GONNA BE--

2123
01:28:58,900 --> 01:29:00,168
BIG.

2124
01:29:00,235 --> 01:29:01,636
REALLY BIG.

2125
01:29:01,703 --> 01:29:03,071
[MAN] PEARL FORRESTER!

2126
01:29:03,138 --> 01:29:06,007
YOU HAVE RETURNED
OUR RUNAWAY CHILDREN TO US!

2127
01:29:06,074 --> 01:29:07,909
[WOMAN] WE ARE VERY GRATEFUL,

2128
01:29:07,976 --> 01:29:10,212
AND WE HOPE THAT THEY
WEREN'T TOO MUCH TROUBLE.

2129
01:29:10,278 --> 01:29:12,147
THEY CAN CERTAINLY
BE A HANDFUL.

2130
01:29:12,214 --> 01:29:14,282
OH, THEY--
THEY SURE CAN WEAR YOU OUT.

2131
01:29:14,349 --> 01:29:15,851
[WOMAN] BOY, TELL ME ABOUT IT.

2132
01:29:15,917 --> 01:29:17,519
LAST WEEK,
THEY WERE VERY NAUGHTY

2133
01:29:17,586 --> 01:29:19,654
AND VAPORIZED
A WHOLE GALAXY.

2134
01:29:19,721 --> 01:29:21,990
OH, ADORABLE LITTLE SCAMPS.

2135
01:29:22,057 --> 01:29:23,458
MOMMY, DADDY, WE WENT
WITH GRANDMA PEARL,

2136
01:29:23,525 --> 01:29:25,527
AND THEN WE DID
A WHOLE BUNCH OF STUFF!

2137
01:29:25,594 --> 01:29:27,028
[TALKING OVER EACH OTHER]

2138
01:29:27,095 --> 01:29:28,630
[MAN] WOW, THAT'S GREAT, KIDS.

2139
01:29:28,697 --> 01:29:30,966
NOW, GET YOUR SHOES ON,
SCOOTER. COME ON.

2140
01:29:31,032 --> 01:29:33,501
[WOMAN] WOULD YOU COME IN FOR
SOME COFFEE AND CARROT CAKE?

2141
01:29:33,568 --> 01:29:35,270
OH, NO, I COULDN'T.

2142
01:29:35,337 --> 01:29:38,373
BESIDES, I'D PROBABLY MELT
IN YOUR PRESENCE OR SOMETHING.

2143
01:29:38,440 --> 01:29:39,941
[MAN] THAT'S TRUE, GOOD POINT.

2144
01:29:40,008 --> 01:29:41,543
BUT THANKS AGAIN, PEARL.

2145
01:29:41,610 --> 01:29:44,312
[WOMAN] BUDDY! DARLENE! SCOOTER!

2146
01:29:44,379 --> 01:29:45,714
COME ALONG, CHILDREN.

2147
01:29:45,780 --> 01:29:48,183
I'M GONNA MISS YOU,
GRANDMA PEARL.

2148
01:29:48,250 --> 01:29:50,752
I'M GONNA MISS YOU MORE
THAN HIM, GREAT-GRANDMA PEARL.

2149
01:29:50,819 --> 01:29:52,220
AND I'M GONNA MISS YOU
MOST OF ALL

2150
01:29:52,287 --> 01:29:53,822
GREAT-GREAT-GRANDMA PEARL!

2151
01:29:53,889 --> 01:29:56,258
OH, I'LL MISS YOU KIDS, TOO.

2152
01:29:56,324 --> 01:29:59,461
GREAT-GREAT-GREAT-
GRANDMA PEARL WILL MISS YOU.

2153
01:29:59,527 --> 01:30:00,996
[WIND CHIMES]

2154
01:30:09,037 --> 01:30:10,138
[LAUGHS]

2155
01:30:10,205 --> 01:30:13,708
ALL RIGHT! I AM FREE!

2156
01:30:13,775 --> 01:30:16,578
GOOD RIDDANCE,
YOU LITTLE NO-NECK MONSTERS!

2157
01:30:16,645 --> 01:30:19,681
- [ROCK MUSIC PLAYING OVER RADIO]
- BLACKJACK TABLE, HERE I COME!

2158
01:30:22,918 --> 01:30:25,720
[MST3K THEME PLAYING]

2159
01:31:24,813 --> 01:31:26,748
{\an8}WHAT DO YOU THINK
WE COME HERE FOR, TO EAT?

